#: manual/api/cli.md:56
msgid "JSON file holding one `@metrics.Input`. Relative paths are relative to the working directory."
msgstr "存放一个 `@metrics.Input` 的 JSON 文件。相对路径相对于工作目录。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:57
msgid "File to write the report to. The file is created or replaced; its directory must exist. Without this option the report goes to standard output."
msgstr "报告要写入的文件。该文件会被创建或替换；其所在目录必须已存在。不带此选项时，报告输出到标准输出。"

