#: manual/api/query_sql.md:29
msgid "Errors"
msgstr "错误"

#: manual/api/cli.md:259
msgid "Usage, parse, decoding and input errors print one JSON object with an `error` key to standard output and exit with status `1`. Nothing is written to the output file."
msgstr "用法错误、解析错误、解码错误和输入错误会向标准输出打印一个带 `error` 键的 JSON 对象，并以状态 `1` 退出。输出文件不会被写入任何内容。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:263
msgid "Situation"
msgstr "情形"

#: manual/api/cli.md:265
msgid "No arguments, or the first argument is not `build-index`"
msgstr "没有参数，或第一个参数不是 `build-index`"

#: manual/api/cli.md:266
msgid "No `--input` followed by a value"
msgstr "没有后面跟有值的 `--input`"

#: manual/api/cli.md:266
msgid "the same usage message"
msgstr "同样的用法消息"

#: manual/api/cli.md:267
msgid "The input file is not valid JSON"
msgstr "输入文件不是合法的 JSON"

#: manual/api/cli.md:267
msgid "the parser's message, such as `{\"error\":\"Invalid character 'o' at line 1, column 1\"}`"
msgstr "解析器的消息，例如 `{\"error\":\"Invalid character 'o' at line 1, column 1\"}`"

#: manual/api/cli.md:268
msgid "The JSON does not decode as `@metrics.Input`"
msgstr "JSON 无法解码为 `@metrics.Input`"

#: manual/api/cli.md:268
msgid "the decoder's message with the JSON path, such as `{\"error\":\"JsonDecodeError((/releases/0, Missing field yanked))\"}`"
msgstr "解码器的消息，带有 JSON 路径，例如 `{\"error\":\"JsonDecodeError((/releases/0, Missing field yanked))\"}`"

#: manual/api/cli.md:269
msgid "`now` is not an RFC 3339 timestamp"
msgstr "`now` 不是 RFC 3339 时间戳"

#: manual/api/cli.md:271
msgid "If the input path cannot be read, the command prints `{\"error\":\"Failed to read input: <path>\"}`. The output path is opened only after the input has been parsed and computed."
msgstr "如果输入路径无法读取，命令会打印 JSON 错误对象。只有在输入解析并计算完成后，才会打开输出路径。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:275
msgid "The texts of the parser and decoder messages come from `moonbitlang/core/json` and may change with the compiler; match on the `error` key, not on the text."
msgstr "解析器和解码器消息的文本来自 `moonbitlang/core/json`，可能随编译器变化；请匹配 `error` 键，而不要匹配文本。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:279
msgid "An output file that cannot be written is still reported by Node.js and may print a stack trace to standard error. Callers should treat any non-zero status as a failure and use the report only on status `0`, as the index builder does."
msgstr "无法写入的输出文件仍由 Node.js 报告，并可能向标准错误打印堆栈跟踪。调用方应将任何非零状态视为失败，并且只在状态为 0 时使用报告，索引构建器就是这样做的。"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:1
msgid "metrics API"
msgstr "metrics API"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:5
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/metrics` measures a registry. It takes every release record of the registry, the current download counts and a short download history, and computes for each package its latest release, its current dependents, the [`@score.Signals`](score.md#signals) now and 30 days ago, and the score snapshot of the [`score` package](score.md). It also returns the current dependency edges and counts per label. Every decision that affects a score is taken here or in `score`; the [`build-index` command](cli.md) runs this computation for the index builder."
msgstr "包 `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/metrics` 对注册表进行度量。它接收注册表的所有发布记录、当前下载量和一段简短的下载量历史，为每个包计算其最新发布、当前依赖方、现在和 30 天前的 [`@score.Signals`](score.md#signals)，以及 [`score` 包](score.md)的分数快照。它还返回当前的依赖边和每个标签的计数。影响分数的每个决定都在这里或在 `score` 中做出；[`build-index` 命令](cli.md)为索引构建器运行这一计算。"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:15
msgid "The computation is pure: it reads no clock and no files, and the same input gives the same report on every backend. The reasons for the counting rules are in the [metrics design](../design/metrics.md)."
msgstr "该计算是纯的：它不读取时钟，也不读取文件，同样的输入在每个后端上都给出同样的报告。计数规则的理由见 [metrics 设计](../design/metrics.md)。"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:19
msgid "Source: [`src/metrics/metrics.mbt`](../../../src/metrics/metrics.mbt), [`src/metrics/time.mbt`](../../../src/metrics/time.mbt) and [`src/metrics/semver.mbt`](../../../src/metrics/semver.mbt)."
msgstr "源码：[`src/metrics/metrics.mbt`](../../../src/metrics/metrics.mbt)、[`src/metrics/time.mbt`](../../../src/metrics/time.mbt) 和 [`src/metrics/semver.mbt`](../../../src/metrics/semver.mbt)。"

