#: manual/api/metrics.md:51
#: manual/api/query.md:250
msgid "JSON form"
msgstr "JSON 形式"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:53
msgid "Every struct of this package converts to and from JSON with the field names as keys. Two rules matter when the JSON is written by another program, as it is for the [`build-index` command](cli.md):"
msgstr "本包的每个结构体都能与 JSON 相互转换，以字段名作为键。当 JSON 由另一个程序写出时（[`build-index` 命令](cli.md)就是如此），有两条规则很重要："

#: manual/api/metrics.md:57
msgid "An `Option` field that is `None` is an absent key, and `Some(x)` is the value of `x`. JSON `null` is not `None`: `\"created_at\": null` fails to decode. Write the key only when there is a value."
msgstr "值为 `None` 的 `Option` 字段表示为不出现的键，`Some(x)` 表示为 `x` 的值。JSON `null` 不是 `None`：`\"created_at\": null` 会解码失败。只在有值时才写出这个键。"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:60
msgid "Every other field is required. A missing key, a value of the wrong type or an integer outside the `Int` range raises `@json.JsonDecodeError`; a fractional number in an `Int` field is truncated. Unknown keys are ignored."
msgstr "其他字段都是必填的。缺少键、值的类型错误或整数超出 `Int` 范围都会抛出 `@json.JsonDecodeError`；`Int` 字段中的小数会被截断。未知的键会被忽略。"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:65
msgid "`Map[String, Int]` fields are JSON objects from names to numbers."
msgstr "`Map[String, Int]` 字段是从名称到数值的 JSON 对象。"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:67
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "常量"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:71
msgid "`RECENT_WINDOW_DAYS` is the length of the window in which a new dependent counts as recent."
msgstr "`RECENT_WINDOW_DAYS` 是一个窗口的长度，新的依赖方在该窗口内算作近期。"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:78
msgid "A dependent is recent at a point in time $\\tau$ when its dependency first appeared after $\\tau - 180$ days and at or before $\\tau$."
msgstr "在时间点 $\\tau$，若某依赖方的依赖关系首次出现于 $\\tau - 180$ 天之后、且不晚于 $\\tau$，则它是近期的。"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:89
msgid "`MOMENTUM_WINDOW_DAYS` is the distance between the two points in time that the momentum compares."
msgstr "`MOMENTUM_WINDOW_DAYS` 是势头所比较的两个时间点之间的距离。"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:96
msgid "The earlier point is `now` minus exactly 30 days of 86 400 000 ms."
msgstr "较早的时间点是 `now` 减去恰好 30 天，每天 86 400 000 ms。"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:108
msgid "`DOWNLOAD_HISTORY_TOLERANCE_DAYS` is how far a download snapshot may be from the 30-days-ago point and still stand for it."
msgstr "`DOWNLOAD_HISTORY_TOLERANCE_DAYS` 规定下载量快照与“30 天前”这一时间点最多相差多远，仍可代表该时间点。"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:115
msgid "A snapshot taken at most 7 days before or after that point qualifies, the bounds included."
msgstr "在该时间点之前或之后至多 7 天拍下的快照都符合条件，边界包含在内。"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:126
msgid "`MILLIS_PER_DAY` is the number of milliseconds in a day, the unit of the timestamps of this package."
msgstr "`MILLIS_PER_DAY` 是一天中的毫秒数，即本包时间戳的单位。"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:133
msgid "The package counts every day as 86 400 seconds, like Unix time; leap seconds do not exist for it."
msgstr "本包把每一天都算作 86 400 秒，与 Unix 时间相同；对它而言不存在闰秒。"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:146
msgid "`Release` is one published version of a package, as listed in the registry index."
msgstr "`Release` 是一个包的一个已发布版本，如注册表索引中所列。"

#: manual/api/metrics.md:159
#: manual/api/metrics.md:242
