msgstr "是否设置了许可证。"

#: manual/api/query.md:122
msgid "The comparison of a term. `name` gives the JSON spelling (`match`, `eq`, `gte`, `lte`), `symbol` the expression spelling (`:`, `=`, `>=`, `<=`), and `from_name` reads a JSON spelling."
msgstr "项的比较方式。`name` 给出 JSON 拼写（`match`、`eq`、`gte`、`lte`），`symbol` 给出表达式拼写（`:`、`=`、`>=`、`<=`），`from_name` 读取 JSON 拼写。"

#: manual/api/query.md:158
msgid "A `Term` keeps its `value` as typed; numeric fields read it with `number_value` when they are evaluated. `negated` defaults to `false` in `Term::make`, `Group::make`, `term` and `group`; `term` and `group` wrap the result in a `Node`. `empty_ast()` is the empty `And` group."
msgstr "`Term` 按输入原样保存 `value`；数值字段在求值时用 `number_value` 读取它。在 `Term::make`、`Group::make`、`term` 和 `group` 中，`negated` 默认为 `false`；`term` 和 `group` 把结果包装在一个 `Node` 中。`empty_ast()` 是空的 `And` 组。"

#: manual/api/query.md:163
msgid "`has_intent` tells whether a tree asks for anything: a term has intent when its value is not blank (after `trim`), a group when one of its children has. A query without intent lists everything. `Node::negated` reads the flag and `toggle_negation` flips it."
msgstr "`has_intent` 判断一棵树是否有所要求：一个项在其值不为空白（经 `trim` 后）时有意图，一个组在其某个子节点有意图时有意图。没有意图的查询会列出全部内容。`Node::negated` 读取该标志，`toggle_negation` 翻转它。"

#: manual/api/query.md:189
msgid "Raised by the parser, the validator and the label checks. The message is the text shown to users."
msgstr "由解析器、验证器和标签检查抛出。消息就是显示给用户的文本。"

#: manual/api/query.md:192
msgid "Expressions"
msgstr "表达式"

#: manual/api/query.md:200
msgid "Parses the native expression language. `NOT` binds tighter than `AND`, which binds tighter than `OR`; parentheses group. A bare word or a quoted string is a `text` match; `field:value`, `field=value`, `field>=value` and `field<=value` are terms. Keywords are case-insensitive, field names are not. A blank expression gives `empty_ast()`; a single term is wrapped in an `And` group."
msgstr "解析原生表达式语言。`NOT` 的结合比 `AND` 紧，`AND` 又比 `OR` 紧；括号用于分组。单独的词或带引号的字符串是一个 `text` 匹配；`field:value`、`field=value`、`field>=value` 和 `field<=value` 是项。关键字不区分大小写，字段名区分大小写。空白表达式给出 `empty_ast()`；单个项会被包装在一个 `And` 组中。"

#: manual/api/query.md:221
msgid "The errors are `Unexpected end of query expression`, `Expected rparen`, `Unexpected trailing query tokens`, `Invalid query term`, `Missing query value`, `Invalid query value`, ``Unsupported query field `<name>` `` and `Unclosed quoted string`."
msgstr "错误有 `Unexpected end of query expression`、`Expected rparen`、`Unexpected trailing query tokens`、`Invalid query term`、`Missing query value`、`Invalid query value`、``Unsupported query field `<name>` `` 和 `Unclosed quoted string`。"

#: manual/api/query.md:232
msgid "Writes a tree as an expression. Values are trimmed and quoted unless they consist of `[A-Za-z0-9_./-]` only and are not a keyword; a group is parenthesised when its connective differs from its parent's or when it is negated. For every tree the parser produces, parsing the result gives a tree that evaluates the same. An empty group has no spelling and is written `()`."
msgstr "把一棵树写成表达式。值会被去除首尾空白并加上引号，除非它只由 `[A-Za-z0-9_./-]` 组成且不是关键字；当一个组的连接词与其父组不同，或该组被取反时，会给它加上括号。对于解析器产生的每一棵树，解析其结果得到的树求值相同。空组没有对应的拼写，写作 `()`。"

#: manual/api/query.md:261
msgid "The JSON form is the one the web interface stores in the `ast` URL parameter:"
msgstr "JSON 形式就是 Web 界面存放在 `ast` URL 参数中的形式："

#: manual/api/query.md:270
msgid "`negated` is written only when it is `true` and read only when it is `true`; other keys are ignored. `validate` checks a JSON value and converts it, `encode` writes the JSON text and `decode` parses and validates JSON text. The validation messages are `Query AST must be an object`, `Query AST root must be a group`, `Query group operator must be and or or`, `Query group children must be an array`, `Query node must be an object`, `Unknown query node kind`, ``Unsupported query field `<name>` ``, ``Unsupported query operator `<name>` ``, `Query term value must be a string` and, for `decode`, `Query AST is not valid JSON: <detail>`."
msgstr "`negated` 只在为 `true` 时写出，也只在为 `true` 时读取；其他键会被忽略。`validate` 检查一个 JSON 值并转换它，`encode` 写出 JSON 文本，`decode` 解析并验证 JSON 文本。验证消息有 `Query AST must be an object`、`Query AST root must be a group`、`Query group operator must be and or or`、`Query group children must be an array`、`Query node must be an object`、`Unknown query node kind`、``Unsupported query field `<name>` ``、``Unsupported query operator `<name>` ``、`Query term value must be a string`，以及 `decode` 特有的 `Query AST is not valid JSON: <detail>`。"

#: manual/api/query.md:294
msgid "Flat search parameters"
msgstr "扁平搜索参数"

#: manual/api/query.md:296
msgid "The web interface also has one parameter per field (`q`, `owner`, `minScore`, …), called the legacy form because it predates the language."
msgstr "Web 界面还为每个字段提供一个参数（`q`、`owner`、`minScore`……），称为旧式形式，因为它早于查询语言出现。"

#: manual/api/query.md:311
msgid "The table of flat parameters, in the order their terms are added:"
msgstr "扁平参数表，按其项被加入的顺序排列："

#: manual/api/query.md:313
msgid "Term"
msgstr "项"

#: manual/api/query.md:317
msgid "`rank=`, `momentum=` (comma-separated lists allowed)"
msgstr "`rank=`、`momentum=`（允许逗号分隔的列表）"

#: manual/api/query.md:322
msgid "`has_repository=`, `has_license=` (value not trimmed)"
msgstr "`has_repository=`、`has_license=`（值不去除首尾空白）"

#: manual/api/query.md:332
msgid "`legacy_params_to_ast` builds an `And` group of one entry per non-blank parameter. A `rank` or `momentum` list becomes one term for one label and an `Or` group of terms for several; labels are canonicalised and an unknown one raises `QueryError`. `decode_from_params` reads the `ast` parameter (when not blank) or else the `expr` parameter; `derive_ast` uses it and falls back to the flat parameters. Missing keys count as blank."
msgstr "`legacy_params_to_ast` 构建一个 `And` 组，每个非空白参数对应一个条目。`rank` 或 `momentum` 列表在只有一个标签时变为一个项，有多个标签时变为由多个项组成的 `Or` 组；标签会被规范化，未知标签会抛出 `QueryError`。`decode_from_params` 读取 `ast` 参数（不为空白时），否则读取 `expr` 参数；`derive_ast` 使用它，并在其没有结果时回退到扁平参数。缺失的键视为空白。"

#: manual/api/query.md:357
msgid "The parameter changes that make a tree the active query: every flat parameter set to `\"\"`, `ast` to `encode(ast)` and `expr` to `serialize(ast)`."
msgstr "使一棵树成为当前查询所需的参数改动：每个扁平参数设为 `\"\"`，`ast` 设为 `encode(ast)`，`expr` 设为 `serialize(ast)`。"

#: manual/api/query.md:360
msgid "Labels"
msgstr "标签"

#: manual/api/query.md:372
msgid "`rank_labels()` is `[\"S\", \"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"]` and `momentum_labels()` is `[\"New\", \"Rising\", \"Stable\", \"Cooling\"]`. They are the only lists of these values in the query, SQL and static search code. The `canonical_*` functions match ignoring ASCII case; `parse_label` does the same for the `Rank` and `Momentum` fields and raises `rank must be one of S, A, B, C, D` (or the momentum equivalent) otherwise. The list parsers split on commas, trim each item, drop blanks and repeats, and raise the same error for an unknown item."
msgstr "`rank_labels()` 为 `[\"S\", \"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"]`，`momentum_labels()` 为 `[\"New\", \"Rising\", \"Stable\", \"Cooling\"]`。在查询、SQL 和静态搜索代码中，它们是这些值仅有的列表。`canonical_*` 函数在忽略 ASCII 大小写的情况下进行匹配；`parse_label` 对 `Rank` 和 `Momentum` 字段做同样的事，否则抛出 `rank must be one of S, A, B, C, D`（或对应的势头消息）。列表解析函数按逗号切分，去除每一项的首尾空白，丢弃空白项和重复项，遇到未知项时抛出同样的错误。"

#: manual/api/query.md:391
msgid "Sorting and paging"
msgstr "排序与分页"

#: manual/api/query.md:419
msgid "The sort keys of the `sort` parameter, named `relevance`, `score`, `growth`, `downloads`, `dependents`, `recent`, `updated`, `name`, `external`, `owners`, `position` and `age`. `relevance`, `name`, `position` and `age` sort ascending by default, the others descending. `default_sort(true)` is `Relevance` (a text query is present), `default_sort(false)` is `Position`."
msgstr "`sort` 参数的排序键，名为 `relevance`、`score`、`growth`、`downloads`、`dependents`、`recent`、`updated`、`name`、`external`、`owners`、`position` 和 `age`。`relevance`、`name`、`position` 和 `age` 默认升序，其余默认降序。`default_sort(true)` 为 `Relevance`（存在文本查询），`default_sort(false)` 为 `Position`。"

#: manual/api/query.md:425
msgid "`page_limit` reads the `limit` parameter: a finite number above zero, truncated and capped at `max_page_limit` (`200`), else `default_page_limit` (`50`). `page_offset` reads `offset`: a finite number of at least zero, truncated, else `0`."
msgstr "`page_limit` 读取 `limit` 参数：一个大于零的有限数，截断取整并以 `max_page_limit`（`200`）为上限，否则为 `default_page_limit`（`50`）。`page_offset` 读取 `offset`：一个不小于零的有限数，截断取整，否则为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/query.md:438
msgid "Text helpers"
msgstr "文本辅助函数"

#: manual/api/query.md:446
msgid "`is_white_space` tests a UTF-16 code unit against the white space of ECMAScript (`\\s`), `trim` removes it from both ends, and `number_value` reads a value the way ECMAScript `Number(text)` does: blank is `0`, `0x`, `0o` and `0b` prefixes are allowed, `Infinity` is infinite, anything else that is not a decimal literal is NaN. They are implemented in MoonBit, so every backend gives the same results as the TypeScript code they replace."
msgstr "`is_white_space` 按 ECMAScript 的空白字符（`\\s`）检验一个 UTF-16 码元，`trim` 从两端去除空白，`number_value` 以 ECMAScript `Number(text)` 的方式读取值：空白为 `0`，允许 `0x`、`0o` 和 `0b` 前缀，`Infinity` 为无穷大，其他不是十进制字面量的内容都是 NaN。它们用 MoonBit 实现，因此每个后端都给出与它们所取代的 TypeScript 代码相同的结果。"

#: manual/api/query.md:461
#: manual/api/query_sql.md:215
#: manual/api/static_search.md:191
msgid "JavaScript boundary"
msgstr "JavaScript 边界"

#: manual/api/query.md:463
msgid "`moon build src/query --target js` writes an ES module that exports the functions below. They take and return strings; a call that can fail returns `{\"ok\":<result>}` or `{\"error\":\"<message>\"}`. [`lib/query.ts`](../../../lib/query.ts) wraps them with the TypeScript types of the web application."
msgstr "`moon build src/query --target js` 写出一个导出下列函数的 ES 模块。它们接收并返回字符串；可能失败的调用返回 `{\"ok\":<result>}` 或 `{\"error\":\"<message>\"}`。[`lib/query.ts`](../../../lib/query.ts) 用 Web 应用的 TypeScript 类型包装它们。"

#: manual/api/query.md:469
#: manual/api/static_search.md:198
msgid "Export"
msgstr "导出项"

#: manual/api/query.md:469
#: manual/api/score.md:467
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: manual/api/query.md:471
msgid "envelope of the tree"
msgstr "树的信封"

#: manual/api/query.md:472
msgid "envelope of the expression"
msgstr "表达式的信封"

#: manual/api/query.md:473
msgid "envelope of the normalised tree"
msgstr "规范化后的树的信封"

#: manual/api/query.md:474
msgid "envelope of `derive_ast`"
msgstr "`derive_ast` 的信封"

#: manual/api/query.md:475
msgid "envelope of the tree or `null`"
msgstr "树或 `null` 的信封"

#: manual/api/query.md:476
msgid "envelope of the parameter patch"
msgstr "参数改动的信封"

#: manual/api/query.md:477
