msgstr "布尔值，输入无效时为 `false`"

#: manual/api/query.md:478
msgid "JSON of the empty tree"
msgstr "空树的 JSON"

#: manual/api/query.md:479
msgid "JSON arrays"
msgstr "JSON 数组"

#: manual/api/query.md:481
msgid "`params_from_json(Json) -> Map[String, String]`, also public, keeps the string members of a JSON object; the boundary functions use it to read parameters."
msgstr "同样公开的 `params_from_json(Json) -> Map[String, String]` 保留 JSON 对象中的字符串成员；边界函数用它读取参数。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:1
msgid "query_sql API"
msgstr "query_sql API"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:5
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/query_sql` turns search requests into SQL for the SQLite database of the dynamic site: a query tree from [`query`](query.md) into a `WHERE` condition, the free-text `q` syntax into an FTS5 `MATCH` expression, and the whole set of `/api/search` parameters into a plan with `FROM`, `WHERE`, `ORDER BY`, `LIMIT` and `OFFSET`. It only produces text and bound values; running the SQL is left to [`lib/data.ts`](../../../lib/data.ts)."
msgstr "包 `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/query_sql` 把搜索请求转换成动态站点 SQLite 数据库的 SQL：把来自 [`query`](query.md) 的查询树转换成 `WHERE` 条件，把自由文本 `q` 语法转换成 FTS5 `MATCH` 表达式，把整套 `/api/search` 参数转换成带有 `FROM`、`WHERE`、`ORDER BY`、`LIMIT` 和 `OFFSET` 的计划。它只产生文本和绑定值；执行 SQL 交给 [`lib/data.ts`](../../../lib/data.ts)。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:13
msgid "The package is pure MoonBit and builds for every target. Source: [`src/query_sql`](../../../src/query_sql/compile.mbt). The [query_sql design](../design/query_sql.md) explains the choices."
msgstr "本包是纯 MoonBit 代码，可为所有目标构建。源码：[`src/query_sql`](../../../src/query_sql/compile.mbt)。[query_sql 设计](../design/query_sql.md)解释了其中的取舍。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:26
msgid "The SQL refers to the tables `packages p`, `package_scores s` and the FTS5 table `search_index` written by `scripts/build_index.py`."
msgstr "SQL 引用表 `packages p`、`package_scores s`，以及由 `scripts/build_index.py` 写入的 FTS5 表 `search_index`。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:38
msgid "Every function that can fail raises `SqlError`; the server answers it with HTTP 400 and the message."
msgstr "所有可能失败的函数都抛出 `SqlError`；服务器以 HTTP 400 和该消息作为响应。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:41
msgid "Values and fragments"
msgstr "值与片段"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:56
msgid "A `Fragment` is SQL with `?` placeholders and their values in order. Its JSON form is `{\"sql\": …, \"values\": [ … ]}` with strings and numbers."
msgstr "`Fragment` 是带有 `?` 占位符的 SQL 及其按顺序排列的值。它的 JSON 形式为 `{\"sql\": …, \"values\": [ … ]}`，值为字符串和数值。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:59
msgid "Compiling a query tree"
msgstr "编译查询树"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:65
msgid "Each term becomes one condition; children are wrapped in parentheses and joined with `AND` or `OR`, negation wraps a part in `NOT (…)`, and an empty group is `1 = 1`."
msgstr "每个项变成一个条件；子节点用括号包裹，并以 `AND` 或 `OR` 连接，取反把一部分包裹在 `NOT (…)` 中，空组为 `1 = 1`。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:69
#: manual/api/score.md:556
#: manual/api/score.md:626
msgid "Condition"
msgstr "条件"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:69
msgid "Accepted operators"
msgstr "接受的运算符"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:71
msgid "FTS5 `MATCH` over all columns, value through `compile_fts_value`"
msgstr "对所有列的 FTS5 `MATCH`，值经过 `compile_fts_value`"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:72
msgid "FTS5 `MATCH` on the column, value through `compile_literal_field_value`"
msgstr "对该列的 FTS5 `MATCH`，值经过 `compile_literal_field_value`"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:73
msgid "`LOWER(COALESCE(p.<field>, '')) LIKE LOWER(?)` with `%value%`"
msgstr "`LOWER(COALESCE(p.<field>, '')) LIKE LOWER(?)`，配合 `%value%`"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:74
msgid "`s.rank_label = ?` / `s.momentum_label = ?` with the canonical label"
msgstr "`s.rank_label = ?` / `s.momentum_label = ?`，配合规范化后的标签"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:75
msgid "`s.score <op> ?`, any finite number"
msgstr "`s.score <op> ?`，任意有限数"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:76
msgid "`p.dependent_count`, `p.recent_dependent_count`, `p.external_dependent_count`, `p.dependent_owner_count`, `p.download_count`, `p.days_since_release`, `s.rank_position` `<op> ?`, an integer"
msgstr "`p.dependent_count`、`p.recent_dependent_count`、`p.external_dependent_count`、`p.dependent_owner_count`、`p.download_count`、`p.days_since_release`、`s.rank_position` `<op> ?`，整数"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:77
msgid "the first four characters of `p.latest_created_at` as an integer"
msgstr "`p.latest_created_at` 的前四个字符，作为整数"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:78
msgid "the column is (not) blank"
msgstr "该列（不）为空白"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:78
msgid "`=` with `true` or `false`"
msgstr "`=`，配合 `true` 或 `false`"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:97
msgid "Errors name the field: ``Field `text` only supports text match``, `rank only supports =`, `rank must be one of S, A, B, C, D`, `rank is empty`, `score must be a valid number`, `dependents must be an integer`, `score is empty`, `score does not support text match`, `has_license must be either true or false`."
msgstr "错误消息会指明字段：``Field `text` only supports text match``、`rank only supports =`、`rank must be one of S, A, B, C, D`、`rank is empty`、`score must be a valid number`、`dependents must be an integer`、`score is empty`、`score does not support text match`、`has_license must be either true or false`。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:103
msgid "Full-text helpers"
msgstr "全文检索辅助函数"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:116
msgid "`compile_fts_expression` compiles the `q` syntax: words, `\"phrases\"`, `field:value` with the aliases of `map_field_alias` (`name`, `author`, `pkg`, `tag`, `desc`, …), `AND`, `OR`, `NOT` and parentheses. It checks the structure first, so FTS5 never sees a syntax error. `foo bar` without an operator is an error."
msgstr "`compile_fts_expression` 编译 `q` 语法：词、`\"phrases\"`、带有 `map_field_alias` 别名（`name`、`author`、`pkg`、`tag`、`desc`……）的 `field:value`、`AND`、`OR`、`NOT` 和括号。它会先检查结构，因此 FTS5 永远不会遇到语法错误。没有运算符的 `foo bar` 是错误。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:121
msgid "`compile_fts_value` turns one operand into a prefix query (`json*`) or a phrase (`\"moonbit-community json5\"`); `compile_literal_field_value` does the same for a single-column value, where quotes are not special."
msgstr "`compile_fts_value` 把一个操作数转换成前缀查询（`json*`）或短语（`\"moonbit-community json5\"`）；`compile_literal_field_value` 对单列的值做同样的事，此时引号没有特殊含义。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:124
msgid "`normalize_fts_text` keeps ASCII letters, digits and `_ . - * #` and collapses everything else to single spaces."
msgstr "`normalize_fts_text` 保留 ASCII 字母、数字和 `_ . - * #`，把其他一切压缩为单个空格。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:126
msgid "`compile_field_expression(column, value)` is `column : <value>`."
msgstr "`compile_field_expression(column, value)` 为 `column : <value>`。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:127
msgid "`build_fts_query` joins the free-text parameters with `AND`."
msgstr "`build_fts_query` 用 `AND` 连接各个自由文本参数。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:128
msgid "`escape_like_pattern` escapes `\\`, `%` and `_` for `LIKE … ESCAPE '\\'`."
msgstr "`escape_like_pattern` 为 `LIKE … ESCAPE '\\'` 转义 `\\`、`%` 和 `_`。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:141
msgid "Parameters and ordering"
msgstr "参数与排序"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:151
msgid "`parse_number(value, label)` gives `None` for `\"\"` and otherwise the value read by `@query.number_value`, which must be finite (and whole with `integer=true`). `parse_boolean` accepts `\"\"`, `true` and `false`. The label functions parse comma-separated lists. `resolve_order_by(sort, order, has_fts)` returns the `ORDER BY` clause:"
msgstr "`parse_number(value, label)` 对 `\"\"` 给出 `None`，否则给出由 `@query.number_value` 读取的值，该值必须有限（`integer=true` 时还必须是整数）。`parse_boolean` 接受 `\"\"`、`true` 和 `false`。标签函数解析逗号分隔的列表。`resolve_order_by(sort, order, has_fts)` 返回 `ORDER BY` 子句："

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:157
msgid "Sort"
msgstr "排序"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:157
msgid "Clause (descending shown)"
msgstr "子句（以降序为例）"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:159
msgid "`bm25(search_index) ASC, s.rank_position ASC, p.full_name ASC` with an FTS5 match, else `s.rank_position ASC, p.full_name ASC`; `order` is ignored"
msgstr "有 FTS5 匹配时为 `bm25(search_index) ASC, s.rank_position ASC, p.full_name ASC`，否则为 `s.rank_position ASC, p.full_name ASC`；`order` 被忽略"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:160
msgid "`s.score`, `s.score_growth_30d`, `p.download_count`, `p.dependent_count`, `p.recent_dependent_count`, `p.external_dependent_count`, `p.dependent_owner_count`, `p.days_since_release` `DESC`, then `s.rank_position ASC, p.full_name ASC`"
msgstr "`s.score`、`s.score_growth_30d`、`p.download_count`、`p.dependent_count`、`p.recent_dependent_count`、`p.external_dependent_count`、`p.dependent_owner_count`、`p.days_since_release` `DESC`，然后是 `s.rank_position ASC, p.full_name ASC`"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:165
msgid "`order` flips the key only; ties are always broken by rank position (best first) and then by name (ascending)."
msgstr "`order` 只翻转排序键本身；并列总是先按名次（最好的在前）、再按名称（升序）打破。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:168
msgid "A blank `sort` is `relevance` with an FTS5 match and `position` without; a blank `order` is the key's default (ascending for `relevance`, `name`, `position`, `age`). Errors: `order must be either asc or desc`, `sort must be one of relevance, score, …, age`."
msgstr "空白的 `sort` 在有 FTS5 匹配时为 `relevance`，否则为 `position`；空白的 `order` 取该排序键的默认值（`relevance`、`name`、`position`、`age` 为升序）。错误：`order must be either asc or desc`、`sort must be one of relevance, score, …, age`。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:173
msgid "Planning a search"
msgstr "规划搜索"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:187
msgid "`plan_search` takes the URL parameters of `/api/search` and validates all of them (numbers, ranges such as `min_score <= max_score` and years between 1970 and 9999, labels, sort and order). Then:"
msgstr "`plan_search` 接收 `/api/search` 的 URL 参数并验证所有参数（数值、诸如 `min_score <= max_score` 的范围和 1970 到 9999 之间的年份、标签、排序和顺序）。然后："

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:191
msgid "if `ast` or `expr` holds a query with intent, the `WHERE` clause is `compile_ast` of it and the order is resolved without FTS5;"
msgstr "如果 `ast` 或 `expr` 含有有意图的查询，`WHERE` 子句就是对它的 `compile_ast`，排序在不考虑 FTS5 的情况下确定；"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:193
msgid "otherwise the flat parameters are joined with `AND`: the text ones as one FTS5 `MATCH` (which also joins `search_index` into `from` for `bm25`), the others as conditions; `rank` and `momentum` lists become `IN (…)`;"
msgstr "否则用 `AND` 连接扁平参数：文本参数合成一个 FTS5 `MATCH`（这也会把 `search_index` 连接进 `from`，以便使用 `bm25`），其他参数作为条件；`rank` 和 `momentum` 列表变为 `IN (…)`；"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:196
msgid "without any criterion the `WHERE` clause is `1 = 1`, so the plan lists every package, by `position` unless a sort is given."
msgstr "没有任何条件时，`WHERE` 子句为 `1 = 1`，因此该计划列出所有包，除非指定了排序，否则按 `position` 排序。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:199
msgid "`limit` and `offset` come from `@query.page_limit` and `@query.page_offset`. The JSON form, used by `lib/data.ts`, is `{\"from\", \"where\", \"values\", \"orderBy\", \"limit\", \"offset\"}`."
msgstr "`limit` 和 `offset` 来自 `@query.page_limit` 和 `@query.page_offset`。`lib/data.ts` 使用的 JSON 形式为 `{\"from\", \"where\", \"values\", \"orderBy\", \"limit\", \"offset\"}`。"

#: manual/api/query_sql.md:217
msgid "The ES module from `moon build src/query_sql --target js` exports `compile_ast_json(ast_json)` and `plan_search_json(params_json)`, which return `{\"ok\": …}` or `{\"error\": \"<message>\"}` envelopes. `searchPackagesFromInput` in [`lib/data.ts`](../../../lib/data.ts) calls `plan_search_json`, runs the `SELECT` and a `COUNT(*)` with the same `WHERE`, and returns `{ items, total }`."
msgstr "由 `moon build src/query_sql --target js` 生成的 ES 模块导出 `compile_ast_json(ast_json)` 和 `plan_search_json(params_json)`，它们返回 `{\"ok\": …}` 或 `{\"error\": \"<message>\"}` 信封。[`lib/data.ts`](../../../lib/data.ts) 中的 `searchPackagesFromInput` 调用 `plan_search_json`，用同一个 `WHERE` 运行 `SELECT` 和 `COUNT(*)`，并返回 `{ items, total }`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:1
msgid "score API"
msgstr "score API"

#: manual/api/score.md:5
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/score` turns the measured signals of a MoonBit package into an impact score, ranks the score within a population of packages, and labels its change over 30 days. Every function is pure and total: it never aborts, has no hidden state and returns the same bits on every backend."
msgstr "包 `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/score` 把度量得到的 MoonBit 包信号转换成影响力分数，在一组包中为分数定级，并为其 30 天内的变化加上标签。每个函数都是纯函数且是全函数：从不中止，没有隐藏状态，并在每个后端上返回逐位相同的结果。"

#: manual/api/score.md:11
msgid "The package does not measure anything. It does not know what a release, a dependency or a registry is; the [`metrics` package](metrics.md) counts the signals from release records and calls this package. The reasoning behind the formula, the weights and the thresholds is in the [score design](../design/score.md)."
msgstr "本包不做任何度量。它不知道什么是发布、依赖或注册表；[`metrics` 包](metrics.md)从发布记录中统计信号并调用本包。公式、权重和阈值背后的理由见 [score 设计](../design/score.md)。"

#: manual/api/score.md:17
msgid "Source: [`src/score/impact_factor.mbt`](../../../src/score/impact_factor.mbt) and [`src/score/log.mbt`](../../../src/score/log.mbt)."
msgstr "源码：[`src/score/impact_factor.mbt`](../../../src/score/impact_factor.mbt) 和 [`src/score/log.mbt`](../../../src/score/log.mbt)。"

#: manual/api/score.md:22
msgid "Add the package to the `moon.pkg` of the package that uses it. The examples on this page call it as `@score`; the JSON examples also import `moonbitlang/core/json`."
msgstr "把本包加入使用它的那个包的 `moon.pkg`。本页示例以 `@score` 调用它；JSON 相关示例还导入了 `moonbitlang/core/json`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:33
msgid "The derived traits of the three structs are used as traits: `Json(value)` converts to JSON, `@json.from_json(json)` converts back, `debug_inspect` and `Repr(value)` print a value, and `==` compares two `Signals`. The methods that older compilers created implicitly from derived traits, such as `to_json`, are not part of the interface."
msgstr "三个结构体的派生 trait 以 trait 的方式使用：`Json(value)` 转换为 JSON，`@json.from_json(json)` 转换回来，`debug_inspect` 和 `Repr(value)` 打印一个值，`==` 比较两个 `Signals`。旧版编译器从派生 trait 隐式生成的方法（如 `to_json`）不属于接口。"

#: manual/api/score.md:43
msgid "[Signals](#signals)"
msgstr "[信号](#signals)"

#: manual/api/score.md:44
msgid "[Score](#score)"
msgstr "[分数](#score)"

#: manual/api/score.md:45
msgid "[Score terms](#score-terms)"
msgstr "[分数项](#score-terms)"

#: manual/api/score.md:46
msgid "[Ranks](#ranks)"
msgstr "[等级](#ranks)"

#: manual/api/score.md:47
msgid "[Momentum](#momentum)"
msgstr "[势头](#momentum)"

#: manual/api/score.md:48
msgid "[Populations](#populations)"
msgstr "[总体](#populations)"

#: manual/api/score.md:50
#: manual/design/score.md:25
msgid "Signals"
msgstr "信号"

#: manual/api/score.md:54
msgid "`Signals` holds the six measured signals of one package at one point in time."
msgstr "`Signals` 存放一个包在某一时间点的六个度量信号。"

#: manual/api/score.md:69
msgid "Packages of other owners whose latest release depends on this package."
msgstr "最新版本依赖本包的其他所有者的包。"

#: manual/api/score.md:70
msgid "Packages of the same owner whose latest release depends on this package."
msgstr "最新版本依赖本包的同一所有者的包。"

#: manual/api/score.md:71
msgid "The external dependents whose dependency first appeared in the last 180 days."
msgstr "依赖关系在最近 180 天内首次出现的外部依赖方。"

#: manual/api/score.md:72
msgid "The same-owner dependents whose dependency first appeared in the last 180 days."
msgstr "依赖关系在最近 180 天内首次出现的同一所有者依赖方。"

#: manual/api/score.md:73
msgid "Download count, `0` when unknown."
msgstr "下载量，未知时为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:74
msgid "Whole days since the latest release; `UNKNOWN_RELEASE_AGE_DAYS` when the date is unknown."
msgstr "距最新发布的整天数；日期未知时为 `UNKNOWN_RELEASE_AGE_DAYS`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:76
msgid "The meanings are those that [`@metrics.compute`](metrics.md#compute) fills in; the functions of this package treat the fields as plain integers. They do not check that the signals are consistent, for example that the recent dependents are at most the dependents. Every function clamps a negative field to `0` before it uses it."
msgstr "这些含义就是 [`@metrics.compute`](metrics.md#compute) 填入的含义；本包的函数把这些字段当作普通整数。它们不检查信号是否一致，例如近期依赖方是否不多于依赖方。每个函数在使用字段之前都会把负值截取为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:82
msgid "The struct is `pub(all)`, so you build it with a struct literal. `ToJson` writes an object with the field names as keys; `FromJson` reads it back and raises `@json.JsonDecodeError` when a field is missing, is not a number, or does not fit in an `Int`. A fractional number is truncated."
msgstr "该结构体是 `pub(all)` 的，因此可以用结构体字面量构造。`ToJson` 写出以字段名为键的对象；`FromJson` 把它读回来，在字段缺失、不是数值或超出 `Int` 范围时抛出 `@json.JsonDecodeError`。小数会被截断。"

#: manual/api/score.md:111
msgid "`clamp_non_negative` returns `value` when it is non-negative and `0` otherwise."
msgstr "`clamp_non_negative` 在 `value` 非负时返回 `value`，否则返回 `0`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:118
msgid "The scoring functions apply it to every signal. It is public so that callers can prepare signals the same way."
msgstr "评分函数会对每个信号应用它。它是公开的，以便调用方用同样的方式准备信号。"

#: manual/api/score.md:131
msgid "`UNKNOWN_RELEASE_AGE_DAYS` is the value of `days_since_release` for a package whose release date is unknown."
msgstr "`UNKNOWN_RELEASE_AGE_DAYS` 是发布日期未知的包的 `days_since_release` 值。"

#: manual/api/score.md:138
msgid "Ten years is far beyond the 365 days after which the multiplier stops falling, so an undated package gets the lowest multiplier, `0.88`."
msgstr "十年远远超过乘数停止下降的 365 天，因此无日期的包得到最低的乘数 `0.88`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:151
msgid "Score"
msgstr "分数"

#: manual/api/score.md:155
msgid "`compute_score` returns the impact score of one package."
msgstr "`compute_score` 返回一个包的影响力分数。"

#: manual/api/score.md:161
msgid "With $\\sigma(x) = \\ln(1 + \\max(x, 0))$, the weighted dependents $D = E + \\tfrac14 O$ (external $E$, same owner $O$), the weighted recent dependents $R$ formed the same way, the downloads $W$ and the days since release $t$, the score is"
msgstr "设 $\\sigma(x) = \\ln(1 + \\max(x, 0))$，加权依赖方 $D = E + \\tfrac14 O$（外部 $E$，同一所有者 $O$），以同样方式构成的加权近期依赖方 $R$，下载量 $W$，距发布的天数 $t$，则分数为"

#: manual/api/score.md:170
msgid "where $m(t)$ is [`activity_multiplier`](#activity_multiplier). It equals `(b.dependents + b.recent_dependents + b.downloads) * b.multiplier` for `b = score_breakdown(signals)`, bit for bit."
msgstr "其中 $m(t)$ 为 [`activity_multiplier`](#activity_multiplier)。对于 `b = score_breakdown(signals)`，它与 `(b.dependents + b.recent_dependents + b.downloads) * b.multiplier` 逐位相等。"

#: manual/api/score.md:174
msgid "The score is finite and non-negative for every input. It is `0` exactly when all five counts are `0` or negative, and it never decreases when a count grows or the release becomes more recent. It has no fixed upper limit; with every count at the largest `Int` it is about `2110`. Scores are comparable across packages because each depends only on that package's signals; the rank and the momentum label depend on the population."
msgstr "对每个输入，分数都是有限且非负的。它为 `0` 当且仅当五个计数都为 `0` 或负数；当某个计数增长或发布变得更近时，它从不减少。它没有固定的上限；所有计数都取最大的 `Int` 时约为 `2110`。由于每个分数只依赖于该包自身的信号，分数可以在包之间比较；等级和势头标签则依赖于总体。"

#: manual/api/score.md:206
msgid "`score_breakdown` returns the three weighted terms of the base score and the multiplier, so that a reader can see where a score comes from."
msgstr "`score_breakdown` 返回基础分数的三个加权项和乘数，让读者能看到分数从何而来。"

#: manual/api/score.md:213
msgid "The fields of the result are"
msgstr "结果的各字段为"

#: manual/api/score.md:215
#: manual/design/static_search.md:46
msgid "Value"
msgstr "值"

#: manual/api/score.md:222
msgid "with the notation of [`compute_score`](#compute_score). Each term is non-negative and the multiplier lies in $[0.88, 1.12]$."
msgstr "记号同 [`compute_score`](#compute_score)。每一项都非负，乘数位于 $[0.88, 1.12]$ 内。"

#: manual/api/score.md:254
msgid "`ScoreBreakdown` is the result of `score_breakdown`."
msgstr "`ScoreBreakdown` 是 `score_breakdown` 的结果。"

#: manual/api/score.md:265
msgid "The fields are read-only outside the package; you obtain a value from `score_breakdown` or from the `breakdown` field of a [`ScoreSnapshot`](#scoresnapshot). `ToJson` and `FromJson` use the field names as keys. The struct does not implement `Eq`; compare the fields or the JSON forms."
msgstr "这些字段在包外是只读的；你可以从 `score_breakdown` 或 [`ScoreSnapshot`](#scoresnapshot) 的 `breakdown` 字段获得一个值。`ToJson` 和 `FromJson` 以字段名为键。该结构体没有实现 `Eq`；请比较各字段或 JSON 形式。"

#: manual/api/score.md:295
msgid "`DEPENDENTS_WEIGHT` is the weight of the dependents term of the base score."
msgstr "`DEPENDENTS_WEIGHT` 是基础分数中依赖方项的权重。"

#: manual/api/score.md:301
msgid "A term is its weight times the logarithmic signal, so the weight is the score gained, before the multiplier, each time the signal plus one grows by the factor $e$. The dependents term has the largest weight of the three."
msgstr "一项等于其权重乘以对数信号，因此权重就是信号加一每增长 $e$ 倍时（乘数之前）获得的分数。在三项中，依赖方项的权重最大。"

#: manual/api/score.md:323
msgid "`RECENT_DEPENDENTS_WEIGHT` is the weight of the recent-dependents term of the base score."
msgstr "`RECENT_DEPENDENTS_WEIGHT` 是基础分数中近期依赖方项的权重。"

#: manual/api/score.md:330
msgid "A recent dependent also counts in the dependents term, so it adds to both terms."
msgstr "近期依赖方同时也计入依赖方项，因此它会增加两项。"

#: manual/api/score.md:351
msgid "`DOWNLOADS_WEIGHT` is the weight of the downloads term of the base score."
msgstr "`DOWNLOADS_WEIGHT` 是基础分数中下载量项的权重。"

#: manual/api/score.md:357
msgid "It is the smallest of the three weights. Downloads count only through their logarithm: 999 downloads give $22 \\ln 1000 \\approx 152$."
msgstr "它是三个权重中最小的。下载量只通过其对数计入：999 次下载给出 $22 \\ln 1000 \\approx 152$。"

#: manual/api/score.md:376
msgid "Score terms"
msgstr "分数项"

#: manual/api/score.md:380
msgid "`weighted_dependents` returns the dependent count that enters the score: external dependents count once, dependents of the same owner count `SELF_DEPENDENT_WEIGHT`."
msgstr "`weighted_dependents` 返回计入分数的依赖方数量：外部依赖方计一次，同一所有者的依赖方按 `SELF_DEPENDENT_WEIGHT` 计。"

#: manual/api/score.md:388
msgid "The arguments are the external and the same-owner count, in this order. Each is clamped to `0` first. The result is exact, because a quarter of an `Int` is representable as a `Double`."
msgstr "参数依次为外部计数和同一所有者计数。每个参数先被截取为不小于 `0`。结果是精确的，因为一个 `Int` 的四分之一可以用 `Double` 精确表示。"

#: manual/api/score.md:402
msgid "`SELF_DEPENDENT_WEIGHT` is the weight of a dependent published by the same owner as the package it depends on."
msgstr "`SELF_DEPENDENT_WEIGHT` 是与被依赖包属于同一所有者的依赖方的权重。"

#: manual/api/score.md:409
msgid "An owner who splits one project into many packages adds one dependent per package. Counting each of them fully would let a package rank on its author's own reuse, so four same-owner dependents weigh as much as one external dependent."
msgstr "把一个项目拆成许多包的所有者，每个包都会增加一个依赖方。如果把它们全部完整计数，一个包就能靠作者自己的复用获得名次，因此四个同一所有者的依赖方与一个外部依赖方权重相同。"

#: manual/api/score.md:432
msgid "`log_signal` returns $\\sigma(x) = \\ln(1 + x)$ for $x > 0$ and `0` otherwise."
msgstr "`log_signal` 在 $x > 0$ 时返回 $\\sigma(x) = \\ln(1 + x)$，否则返回 `0`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:438
msgid "Zero, negative values, `-Infinity` and `NaN` all give `0`; `+Infinity` gives `+Infinity`. The function uses [`ln`](#ln), so it returns the same bits on every backend."
msgstr "零、负值、`-Infinity` 和 `NaN` 都给出 `0`；`+Infinity` 给出 `+Infinity`。该函数使用 [`ln`](#ln)，因此在每个后端上返回逐位相同的结果。"

#: manual/api/score.md:454
msgid "`ln` returns the natural logarithm of `x`."
msgstr "`ln` 返回 `x` 的自然对数。"

#: manual/api/score.md:460
msgid "The function is a port of the fdlibm `e_log.c` routine built only from IEEE 754 basic operations and bit manipulation. Its error is below one unit in the last place, and, unlike `@math.ln`, which calls the platform's `Math.log` on the JavaScript backend, it returns the same bits on every backend, so scores and ranks do not depend on the backend. The special values follow IEEE 754:"
msgstr "该函数移植自 fdlibm 的 `e_log.c` 例程，只由 IEEE 754 基本运算和位操作构成。其误差小于最后一位的一个单位；`@math.ln` 在 JavaScript 后端上调用平台的 `Math.log`，而它与之不同，在每个后端上都返回逐位相同的结果，因此分数和等级不依赖于后端。特殊值遵循 IEEE 754："

#: manual/api/score.md:469
msgid "`+0.0` or `-0.0`"
msgstr "`+0.0` 或 `-0.0`"

#: manual/api/score.md:470
msgid "negative, including `-Infinity`"
msgstr "负数，包括 `-Infinity`"

#: manual/api/score.md:473
msgid "subnormal"
msgstr "次正规数"

#: manual/api/score.md:473
msgid "finite, for example `ln(5.0e-324)` is about `-744.44`"
msgstr "有限值，例如 `ln(5.0e-324)` 约为 `-744.44`"

#: manual/api/score.md:488
msgid "`activity_multiplier` returns the release-recency factor $m(t)$ that scales the whole base score."
msgstr "`activity_multiplier` 返回发布时效因子 $m(t)$，用于缩放整个基础分数。"

#: manual/api/score.md:503
msgid "A negative `days_since_release` counts as `0`. The function is continuous and non-increasing; it is `1.0` near 197.5 days, halfway through the slope."
msgstr "负的 `days_since_release` 按 `0` 计。该函数连续且不增；在约 197.5 天、即斜坡的中点处，它等于 `1.0`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:517
msgid "Ranks"
msgstr "等级"

#: manual/api/score.md:521
msgid "`rank_positions` returns the competition rank of every score, best first."
msgstr "`rank_positions` 返回每个分数的竞赛式名次，最好的在前。"

#: manual/api/score.md:527
msgid "The position of a score is one plus the number of strictly greater scores, so equal scores share a position and the next position is skipped (\"1, 2, 2, 4\"). The result has the same length and order as the input. `NaN` counts as smaller than every number, and all `NaN` values share the last position. `0.0` and `-0.0` are equal. An empty view gives an empty array."
msgstr "一个分数的名次等于一加上严格大于它的分数的个数，因此相等的分数共享一个名次，下一个名次被跳过（“1, 2, 2, 4”）。结果与输入长度相同、顺序相同。`NaN` 视为小于所有数，所有 `NaN` 值共享最后一个名次。`0.0` 与 `-0.0` 相等。空视图给出空数组。"

#: manual/api/score.md:545
msgid "`rank_label` returns the rank label `S`, `A`, `B`, `C` or `D` of a package at competition position `position` (`1` is best) among `population` packages."
msgstr "`rank_label` 返回在 `population` 个包中处于竞赛名次 `position`（`1` 为最好）的包的等级标签 `S`、`A`、`B`、`C` 或 `D`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:552
msgid "The arguments are the position, the population and the package's score. With $q = (\\text{position} - 1) / \\text{population}$, the share of the population that scores strictly higher:"
msgstr "参数依次为名次、总体规模和该包的分数。设 $q = (\\text{position} - 1) / \\text{population}$，即总体中分数严格更高者所占的比例："

#: manual/api/score.md:556
#: manual/api/score.md:626
msgid "Label"
msgstr "标签"

#: manual/api/score.md:564
msgid "A package without any signal is always `D`: the label is `D` when `score` is `0`, negative or `NaN`, whatever its position. It is also `D` when `population` or `position` is `0` or negative. Tied packages share a position and therefore a label. Use the positions from `rank_positions` over the same population; the function does not check that `position` is at most `population`."
msgstr "没有任何信号的包总是 `D`：当 `score` 为 `0`、负数或 `NaN` 时，无论名次如何，标签都是 `D`。当 `population` 或 `position` 为 `0` 或负数时，标签也是 `D`。并列的包共享一个名次，因而也共享一个标签。请使用 `rank_positions` 在同一总体上得到的名次；该函数不检查 `position` 是否不超过 `population`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:585
msgid "`rank_labels` returns the rank labels, best first."
msgstr "`rank_labels` 返回各等级标签，最好的在前。"

#: manual/api/score.md:591
msgid "The result is `[\"S\", \"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"]`, and every result of `rank_label` is one of its elements. Each call returns a new array, so changing it does not affect later calls. The query language and the search take the labels from here instead of repeating them."
msgstr "结果为 `[\"S\", \"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"]`，`rank_label` 的每个结果都是其中的元素。每次调用都返回一个新数组，因此修改它不会影响之后的调用。查询语言和搜索从这里获取标签，而不是重复列出它们。"

#: manual/api/score.md:611
#: manual/design/score.md:141
msgid "Momentum"
msgstr "势头"

#: manual/api/score.md:615
msgid "`compute_momentum_label` returns `New`, `Rising`, `Cooling` or `Stable` from a package's score now and 30 days ago."
msgstr "`compute_momentum_label` 根据一个包现在和 30 天前的分数返回 `New`、`Rising`、`Cooling` 或 `Stable`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:622
msgid "The second argument is `None` when the package had no release 30 days ago. With the change $G = S - S_{30}$ and the threshold $T = \\max(\\texttt{MOMENTUM\\_MIN\\_CHANGE},\\ \\texttt{MOMENTUM\\_MIN\\_RATIO} \\cdot S_{30})$:"
msgstr "当该包 30 天前还没有发布时，第二个参数为 `None`。设变化量 $G = S - S_{30}$，阈值 $T = \\max(\\texttt{MOMENTUM\\_MIN\\_CHANGE},\\ \\texttt{MOMENTUM\\_MIN\\_RATIO} \\cdot S_{30})$："

#: manual/api/score.md:628
msgid "`score_30d_ago` is `None`"
msgstr "`score_30d_ago` 为 `None`"

#: manual/api/score.md:631
msgid "otherwise"
msgstr "其余情况"

#: manual/api/score.md:633
msgid "The threshold is at least 10 points and at least 10 % of the earlier score, so a large package needs a large change and a small one cannot change its label with a handful of points. A `NaN` score or earlier score gives `Stable`, unless the earlier score is `None`."
msgstr "阈值至少为 10 分，且至少为原分数的 10 %，因此大包需要较大的变化，而小包也不能靠几分就改变标签。分数或原分数为 `NaN` 时给出 `Stable`，除非原分数为 `None`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:652
msgid "`momentum_labels` returns the momentum labels."
msgstr "`momentum_labels` 返回各势头标签。"

#: manual/api/score.md:658
msgid "The result is `[\"New\", \"Rising\", \"Stable\", \"Cooling\"]`, and every result of `compute_momentum_label` is one of its elements. Each call returns a new array."
msgstr "结果为 `[\"New\", \"Rising\", \"Stable\", \"Cooling\"]`，`compute_momentum_label` 的每个结果都是其中的元素。每次调用都返回一个新数组。"

#: manual/api/score.md:679
msgid "`MOMENTUM_MIN_CHANGE` is the smallest change of the score, in points, that counts as momentum."
msgstr "`MOMENTUM_MIN_CHANGE` 是算作势头的分数最小变化量，以分计。"

#: manual/api/score.md:686
msgid "It decides the threshold while the earlier score is below 100."
msgstr "在原分数低于 100 时，它决定阈值。"

#: manual/api/score.md:699
msgid "`MOMENTUM_MIN_RATIO` is the smallest change of the score, as a share of its value 30 days ago, that counts as momentum."
msgstr "`MOMENTUM_MIN_RATIO` 是算作势头的分数最小变化量，以占 30 天前分数的比例计。"

#: manual/api/score.md:706
msgid "It decides the threshold from an earlier score of 100 up."
msgstr "从原分数 100 起，它决定阈值。"

#: manual/api/score.md:717
msgid "Populations"
msgstr "总体"

#: manual/api/score.md:721
msgid "`score_population` scores a whole population of packages and returns one `ScoreSnapshot` per package."
msgstr "`score_population` 为一整个总体的包评分，每个包返回一个 `ScoreSnapshot`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:728
msgid "`current[i]` holds the signals of package `i` now, and `past[i]` its signals 30 days ago, or `None` when the package had no release then. The result has the length and order of `current`. When `past` is shorter than `current`, the missing entries count as `None`; extra entries are ignored."
msgstr "`current[i]` 存放包 `i` 现在的信号，`past[i]` 存放它 30 天前的信号；该包当时还没有发布时为 `None`。结果与 `current` 长度相同、顺序相同。当 `past` 比 `current` 短时，缺失的条目视为 `None`；多出的条目会被忽略。"

#: manual/api/score.md:733
msgid "The function computes every score with `compute_score`, the positions with `rank_positions` over all current scores, and for package `i`:"
msgstr "该函数用 `compute_score` 计算每个分数，用 `rank_positions` 在所有当前分数上计算名次，并对包 `i`："

#: manual/api/score.md:736
msgid "`rank_label` is `rank_label(position, current.length(), score)`;"
msgstr "`rank_label` 为 `rank_label(position, current.length(), score)`；"

#: manual/api/score.md:737
msgid "`score_30d_ago` is the score of `past[i]`, or `0` for `None`;"
msgstr "`score_30d_ago` 为 `past[i]` 的分数，`None` 时为 `0`；"

#: manual/api/score.md:738
msgid "`momentum_label` is `compute_momentum_label(score, past score)`, so a package with `None` is `New`."
msgstr "`momentum_label` 为 `compute_momentum_label(score, past score)`，因此 `None` 的包为 `New`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:741
msgid "Positions and labels are relative to the population you pass: the same signals can be `S` in a small population and `C` in a large one. An empty population gives an empty array."
msgstr "名次和标签都相对于你传入的总体：同样的信号在小总体中可能是 `S`，在大总体中可能是 `C`。空总体给出空数组。"

#: manual/api/score.md:793
msgid "The second and third packages tie and share position 2 and label `B`; position 3 is skipped. The third package has no earlier signals and the fourth falls beyond the end of `past`, so both are `New`. The fourth has no signal at all and is `D` whatever its position."
msgstr "第二个和第三个包并列，共享名次 2 和标签 `B`；名次 3 被跳过。第三个包没有较早的信号，第四个包超出了 `past` 的末尾，因此两者都是 `New`。第四个包完全没有信号，无论名次如何都是 `D`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:800
msgid "`ScoreSnapshot` is the full result of scoring one package within a population."
msgstr "`ScoreSnapshot` 是在一个总体中对一个包评分的完整结果。"

#: manual/api/score.md:819
msgid "The current score $S$."
msgstr "当前分数 $S$。"

#: manual/api/score.md:820
msgid "The score $S_{30}$ of the signals 30 days ago; `0` when the package had no release then."
msgstr "30 天前信号的分数 $S_{30}$；该包当时还没有发布时为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:821
msgid "$G = S - S_{30}$; negative when the score fell."
msgstr "$G = S - S_{30}$；分数下降时为负。"

#: manual/api/score.md:822
msgid "$G / S_{30}$ when $S_{30} > 0$; otherwise `1` when $G > 0$ and `0` when $G \\le 0$."
msgstr "当 $S_{30} > 0$ 时为 $G / S_{30}$；否则 $G > 0$ 时为 `1`，$G \\le 0$ 时为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:823
msgid "`S`, `A`, `B`, `C` or `D`, see [`rank_label`](#rank_label)."
msgstr "`S`、`A`、`B`、`C` 或 `D`，见 [`rank_label`](#rank_label)。"

#: manual/api/score.md:824
msgid "Competition position in the population, `1` is best."
msgstr "在总体中的竞赛名次，`1` 为最好。"

#: manual/api/score.md:825
msgid "`New`, `Rising`, `Cooling` or `Stable`, see [`compute_momentum_label`](#compute_momentum_label)."
msgstr "`New`、`Rising`、`Cooling` 或 `Stable`，见 [`compute_momentum_label`](#compute_momentum_label)。"

#: manual/api/score.md:826
msgid "$m(t)$ of the current signals."
msgstr "当前信号的 $m(t)$。"

#: manual/api/score.md:827
msgid "`score_breakdown` of the current signals."
msgstr "当前信号的 `score_breakdown`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:829
msgid "The fields are read-only outside the package; build snapshots with `score_population`. A growth ratio of `1` means either \"doubled\" or \"grew from nothing\"; `score_30d_ago == 0.0` tells them apart. `ToJson` writes an object with the field names as keys, in declaration order, and `breakdown` as a nested object; this is the `snapshot` object of the [`build-index` report](cli.md). `FromJson` reads the same form. The struct does not implement `Eq`; compare the fields or the JSON forms."
msgstr "这些字段在包外是只读的；请用 `score_population` 构造快照。增长比例为 `1` 既可能表示“翻倍”，也可能表示“从无到有”；`score_30d_ago == 0.0` 可以区分两者。`ToJson` 写出一个以字段名为键、按声明顺序排列的对象，`breakdown` 为嵌套对象；这就是 [`build-index` 报告](cli.md)中的 `snapshot` 对象。`FromJson` 读取同样的形式。该结构体没有实现 `Eq`；请比较各字段或 JSON 形式。"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:1
msgid "static_search API"
msgstr "static_search API"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:5
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/static_search` is the search engine of the static site. It reads the exported search index, evaluates [`query`](query.md) trees against its records, counts relevance, sorts with the static site's rules and cuts pages. The browser runs it in a Web Worker through the generated JavaScript module; MoonBit code can call it directly."
msgstr "包 `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/static_search` 是静态站点的搜索引擎。它读取导出的搜索索引，用 [`query`](query.md) 树对其中的记录求值，计算相关度，按静态站点的规则排序并切分页面。浏览器通过生成的 JavaScript 模块在 Web Worker 中运行它；MoonBit 代码可以直接调用它。"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:11
msgid "The package is pure MoonBit and builds for every target. Text is lower-cased and names are collated by the package itself, so the results do not depend on the host's `toLowerCase` or `localeCompare`."
msgstr "本包是纯 MoonBit 代码，可为所有目标构建。文本的小写转换和名称的排序规则都由本包自己实现，因此结果不依赖于宿主的 `toLowerCase` 或 `localeCompare`。"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:15
msgid "Source: [`src/static_search`](../../../src/static_search/search.mbt). The [static_search design](../design/static_search.md) derives the ranking and its cost."
msgstr "源码：[`src/static_search`](../../../src/static_search/search.mbt)。[static_search 设计](../design/static_search.md)推导了排序方式及其开销。"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:28
msgid "Index records"
msgstr "索引记录"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:64
msgid "One record of `search/search-index.json`, as far as searching needs it; the `normalized_*` texts are lower case already. `from_json` reads one record and ignores unknown members; a missing or mistyped member raises `IndexError(\"Index item field `<name>` must be …\")`. `parse_index` reads a document `{\"items\": [ … ]}` or a bare array."
msgstr "`search/search-index.json` 中的一条记录，只包含搜索所需的部分；`normalized_*` 文本已经是小写。`from_json` 读取一条记录并忽略未知成员；成员缺失或类型错误时抛出 `IndexError(\"Index item field `<name>` must be …\")`。`parse_index` 读取文档 `{\"items\": [ … ]}` 或裸数组。"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:70
msgid "Evaluating queries"
msgstr "对查询求值"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:79
msgid "`match_term` tests one term, ignoring its negation:"
msgstr "`match_term` 检验一个项，忽略其取反："

#: manual/api/static_search.md:81
msgid "Holds when"
msgstr "成立条件"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:83
msgid "the trimmed, lower-cased value is a substring of the record's text (a blank value always holds)"
msgstr "去除首尾空白并转为小写的值是记录文本的子串（空白值总是成立）"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:84
msgid "the same test holds for one of the keywords"
msgstr "同样的检验对某个关键词成立"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:85
msgid "the label equals the value read with `@query.parse_label` (case and surrounding spaces ignored); a value that is no label is compared as given"
msgstr "标签等于用 `@query.parse_label` 读取的值（忽略大小写和两侧空格）；不是标签的值按原样比较"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:86
msgid "the number compares with `@query.number_value(value)`: `>=`, `<=`, and `=` for both `=` and `:`; never for a value that is not a finite number"
msgstr "数值与 `@query.number_value(value)` 比较：`>=`、`<=`，`=` 和 `:` 都按 `=` 处理；值不是有限数时从不成立"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:87
msgid "the flag equals `value == \"true\"`"
msgstr "标志等于 `value == \"true\"`"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:89
msgid "`evaluate` applies negation and the connectives (an empty `And` group holds, an empty `Or` group does not). `relevance` counts the positive term leaves the record matches; a leaf below an odd number of `NOT`s counts zero. `package_year` reads the first four characters of `latest_created_at` (`0` when missing or not a number)."
msgstr "`evaluate` 应用取反和连接词（空 `And` 组成立，空 `Or` 组不成立）。`relevance` 统计记录所匹配的正项叶子数；位于奇数个 `NOT` 之下的叶子计为零。`package_year` 读取 `latest_created_at` 的前四个字符（缺失或不是数字时为 `0`）。"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:128
msgid "Searching"
msgstr "搜索"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:139
msgid "`search_items(items, params)` runs one search with the parameters of the web interface (`q`, `owner`, `packageName`, …, `rank`, `momentum`, `sort`, `order`, `expr`, `ast`, `limit`, `offset`): it derives the tree with `@query.derive_ast`, keeps the records for which `evaluate` holds (all of them when the tree has no intent), sorts them with `sort_indices` and returns the page given by `@query.page_limit` and `@query.page_offset`. `indices` refer to `items`; `total` is the number of matches before paging. An invalid query or label raises `QueryError`."
msgstr "`search_items(items, params)` 用 Web 界面的参数（`q`、`owner`、`packageName`、……、`rank`、`momentum`、`sort`、`order`、`expr`、`ast`、`limit`、`offset`）执行一次搜索：它用 `@query.derive_ast` 推导查询树，保留 `evaluate` 成立的记录（树没有意图时保留全部），用 `sort_indices` 排序，并返回由 `@query.page_limit` 和 `@query.page_offset` 给出的那一页。`indices` 指向 `items`；`total` 是分页之前的匹配数。无效的查询或标签会抛出 `QueryError`。"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:148
msgid "`sort_indices` orders record indices:"
msgstr "`sort_indices` 对记录下标排序："

#: manual/api/static_search.md:150
msgid "a blank `sort` is `relevance` when the tree has intent and `position` otherwise; a blank `order` is `asc` for `relevance`, `name`, `position` and `age` and `desc` for the others; an unknown `sort` orders like `score`;"
msgstr "空白的 `sort` 在树有意图时为 `relevance`，否则为 `position`；空白的 `order` 对 `relevance`、`name`、`position` 和 `age` 为 `asc`，对其他为 `desc`；未知的 `sort` 按 `score` 的方式排序；"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:154
msgid "`relevance` sorts by relevance (most first) and ignores `order`;"
msgstr "`relevance` 按相关度排序（最高的在前），忽略 `order`；"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:155
msgid "every other key compares its value (`score`, `score_growth_30d`, `download_count`, `dependent_count`, `recent_dependent_count`, the release year for `updated`, `external_dependent_count`, `dependent_owner_count`, `rank_position`, `days_since_release`) in the chosen direction; `name` compares names with `collate`;"
msgstr "其他每个排序键都按所选方向比较其值（`score`、`score_growth_30d`、`download_count`、`dependent_count`、`recent_dependent_count`、`updated` 对应的发布年份、`external_dependent_count`、`dependent_owner_count`、`rank_position`、`days_since_release`）；`name` 用 `collate` 比较名称；"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:160
msgid "ties are broken by rank position (best first), then by name with `collate` (ascending), whatever the direction, and finally by index."
msgstr "无论方向如何，并列都先按名次（最好的在前）、再按 `collate` 比较名称（升序）打破，最后按下标打破。"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:163
msgid "Text"
msgstr "文本"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:171
msgid "`normalize_text` lower-cases ASCII, Latin-1, Latin Extended-A, Greek and Coptic, Cyrillic (U+0400 to U+052F) and the fullwidth Latin capitals like ECMAScript `toLowerCase`, except that `Σ` always becomes `σ`; other characters are kept. `collate` compares names: negative when the first sorts first, zero only for identical strings. For ASCII it is the CLDR root order that `localeCompare` gives in an English browser (punctuation, then digits, then letters with case ignored, then lower case before upper case). `runtime_version` is `\"static-search-v2\"`."
msgstr "`normalize_text` 像 ECMAScript `toLowerCase` 一样把 ASCII、Latin-1、拉丁文扩展 A、希腊文和科普特文、西里尔文（U+0400 到 U+052F）以及全角拉丁大写字母转为小写，只是 `Σ` 总是变为 `σ`；其他字符保持不变。`collate` 比较名称：第一个排在前面时为负，仅当两个字符串完全相同时为零。对 ASCII 而言，它就是英文浏览器中 `localeCompare` 给出的 CLDR 根排序（标点，然后是数字，然后是忽略大小写的字母，然后小写排在大写之前）。`runtime_version` 为 `\"static-search-v2\"`。"

