msgid "`moon build src/static_search --target js` writes an ES module with these exports; `scripts/build_moonbit.mjs` copies it to `lib/moonbit/static_search/`, and [`lib/static-search.ts`](../../../lib/static-search.ts) wraps it."
msgstr "`moon build src/static_search --target js` 写出带有这些导出项的 ES 模块；`scripts/build_moonbit.mjs` 把它复制到 `lib/moonbit/static_search/`，再由 [`lib/static-search.ts`](../../../lib/static-search.ts) 包装。"

