#: manual/architecture.md:1
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#: manual/architecture.md:3
msgid "`mooncake_impact_factor` is a MoonBit module inside a larger application. The MoonBit packages define the registry signals, the score rules, the search query language, its SQL compilation and the static search engine; Python moves the data; a Next.js application serves it, either dynamically from SQLite or as static files. This guide follows the data from the registry to the browser and names the file responsible for each step."
msgstr "`mooncake_impact_factor` 是一个更大应用中的 MoonBit 模块。MoonBit 包定义注册表信号、评分规则、搜索查询语言及其 SQL 编译，以及静态搜索引擎；Python 搬运数据；Next.js 应用提供服务，既可以基于 SQLite 动态运行，也可以作为静态文件发布。本指南沿着数据从注册表到浏览器的路径，指出每一步由哪个文件负责。"

