msgstr "索引的计算时间、总体规模、最高分数、各标签计数，以及是否使用了下载量历史。"

#: manual/architecture.md:78
msgid "The pages live under one segment per language, as on the documentation site: `/en/`, `/zh-cn/` and `/ja/` are the rankings, `/<lang>/package/?name=<full name>` a package and `/<lang>/method/` the explanation of the score. `/` picks the reader's stored choice (`lf-lang`), then the browser's languages, then English; `/search` and `/advanced-search` from version 0.1 redirect with their filters."
msgstr "页面与文档站点一样，按语言分在各自的路径段下：`/en/`、`/zh-cn/` 和 `/ja/` 是排名页，`/<lang>/package/?name=<full name>` 是包页面，`/<lang>/method/` 是分数说明页。`/` 依次根据读者保存的选择（`lf-lang`）、浏览器的语言选择语言，最后回退到英文；0.1 版本的 `/search` 和 `/advanced-search` 会带着其筛选条件重定向。"

#: manual/architecture.md:85
msgid "The [getting started guide](getting_started.md#3-query-the-apis) lists the search parameters. `lib/data.ts` passes them to `plan_search` of [`query_sql`](api/query_sql.md), which validates them and returns the `FROM`, `WHERE`, `ORDER BY` and paging of the statement; queries in the `ast` or `expr` parameters become `WHERE` clauses, text terms use FTS5. A request without criteria lists every package by rank position."
msgstr "[入门指南](getting_started.md#3-query-the-apis)列出了搜索参数。`lib/data.ts` 把它们传给 [`query_sql`](api/query_sql.md) 的 `plan_search`，后者验证参数并返回语句的 `FROM`、`WHERE`、`ORDER BY` 和分页；`ast` 或 `expr` 参数中的查询变为 `WHERE` 子句，文本项使用 FTS5。没有任何条件的请求按名次列出所有包。"

#: manual/architecture.md:92
msgid "Static mode"
msgstr "静态模式"

#: manual/architecture.md:94
msgid "`npm run build:static-data` runs the index builder and then `scripts/export_static_json.py`, which writes the feeds, a search index, one file per package (`owner--name.json`, with every `/` of the full name replaced by `--`) and a manifest with the index metadata to `public/data`. `npm run build:static` builds the MoonBit modules and runs `next build --webpack` with `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_MODE=static`, which exports the site to `out/` without route handlers. In the browser, feeds and package pages are plain file fetches and search runs in a Web Worker that calls the `static_search` engine compiled to JavaScript; the [static_search design](design/static_search.md) describes it."
msgstr "`npm run build:static-data` 先运行索引构建器，再运行 `scripts/export_static_json.py`，后者把各个 feed、一个搜索索引、每个包一个文件（`owner--name.json`，完整名称中的每个 `/` 都替换为 `--`）以及一个带有索引元数据的清单写入 `public/data`。`npm run build:static` 构建 MoonBit 模块，并以 `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_MODE=static` 运行 `next build --webpack`，把站点导出到不含路由处理器的 `out/`。在浏览器中，feed 和包页面只是普通的文件请求，搜索则在 Web Worker 中运行，由它调用编译为 JavaScript 的 `static_search` 引擎；[static_search 设计](design/static_search.md)对此有详细说明。"

#: manual/architecture.md:105
msgid "MoonBit modules in the web code"
msgstr "Web 代码中的 MoonBit 模块"

#: manual/architecture.md:107
msgid "`scripts/build_moonbit.mjs` runs `moon build src/query src/query_sql src/static_search --target js --release` and copies each generated ES module, with its `.d.ts` files, to `lib/moonbit/<package>/` (ignored by git). npm runs it before `dev`, `build`, `typecheck` and `test` (`npm run build:moonbit` runs it alone). The modules exchange JSON strings: `lib/query.ts` wraps `query`, `lib/data.ts` calls `query_sql`, and `lib/static-search.ts` wraps `static_search` for the worker. The `deploy-static` workflow rebuilds and publishes this site daily."
msgstr "`scripts/build_moonbit.mjs` 运行 `moon build src/query src/query_sql src/static_search --target js --release`，并把生成的每个 ES 模块连同其 `.d.ts` 文件复制到 `lib/moonbit/<package>/`（被 git 忽略）。npm 在 `dev`、`build`、`typecheck` 和 `test` 之前运行它（`npm run build:moonbit` 单独运行它）。这些模块之间交换 JSON 字符串：`lib/query.ts` 包装 `query`，`lib/data.ts` 调用 `query_sql`，`lib/static-search.ts` 为 worker 包装 `static_search`。`deploy-static` 工作流每天重建并发布这个站点。"

#: manual/architecture.md:119
msgid "The interface is localised the way the documentation site localises its own. English strings by key live in `web/i18n/conf.json`, translations in `web/i18n/locale/<locale>/LC_MESSAGES/app.po`, and the locales in `web/i18n/locales.json`, a copy of the site's `config/locales.json`. `node scripts/i18n.mjs update` regenerates `app.pot` and merges it into every catalog with lunadoc's msgmerge semantics, `check` fails when a catalog is behind or a translation drops a `{placeholder}`, and `compile` writes the table that `t(lang, key, vars)` reads; npm runs `compile` before `dev`, `build`, `typecheck` and `test`."
msgstr "界面的本地化方式与文档站点本地化自身的方式相同。按键组织的英文字符串位于 `web/i18n/conf.json`，翻译位于 `web/i18n/locale/<locale>/LC_MESSAGES/app.po`，语言列表位于 `web/i18n/locales.json`，它是站点 `config/locales.json` 的副本。`node scripts/i18n.mjs update` 重新生成 `app.pot`，并以 lunadoc 的 msgmerge 语义把它合并到每个翻译目录；当某个目录落后或某条翻译丢失了 `{placeholder}` 时，`check` 会失败；`compile` 写出 `t(lang, key, vars)` 读取的表。npm 在 `dev`、`build`、`typecheck` 和 `test` 之前运行 `compile`。"

