#: manual/getting_started.md:79
msgid "`npm run dev` first builds the MoonBit modules the web code imports and compiles the interface strings. Then open `http://127.0.0.1:3000`, which sends you to `/en/`, `/zh-cn/` or `/ja/` by your stored or browser language."
