msgstr "`/<lang>/package/?name=<owner>/<name>`：单个包：排名位置、分数从何而来、最近 30 天、被依赖、依赖、发布记录"

#: manual/getting_started.md:90
msgid "`/<lang>/method/`: how scores work"
msgstr "`/<lang>/method/`：评分方法"

