msgid "3. Query the APIs"
msgstr "3. 调用 API"

#: manual/getting_started.md:95
msgid "Search:"
msgstr "搜索："

#: manual/getting_started.md:101
msgid "Supported search parameters:"
msgstr "支持的搜索参数："

#: manual/getting_started.md:103
msgid "`ast`: a serialized query tree (see the [query API](api/query.md))"
msgstr "`ast`：序列化的查询树（见 [query API](api/query.md)）"

#: manual/getting_started.md:104
msgid "`expr`: native boolean search expression compiled into the shared query AST"
msgstr "`expr`：会被编译到共享查询 AST 的原生布尔表达式"

#: manual/getting_started.md:105
msgid "`q`: global full-text query with `AND`, `OR`, `NOT`, parentheses, quoted phrases, and field prefixes such as `owner:`, `author:`, `package:`, `keyword:`, `description:`, and `name:`"
msgstr "`q`：全局全文检索，支持 `AND`、`OR`、`NOT`、括号、引号短语，以及 `owner:`、`author:`、`package:`、`keyword:`、`description:`、`name:` 等字段前缀"

#: manual/getting_started.md:106
msgid "`owner`, `package`, `keyword`, `description`: field-specific full-text filters combined with `AND`"
msgstr "`owner`、`package`、`keyword`、`description`：字段级全文检索，彼此按 `AND` 组合"

#: manual/getting_started.md:107
msgid "`license`, `repository`: metadata substring filters"
msgstr "`license`、`repository`：元数据子串过滤"

#: manual/getting_started.md:108
msgid "`rank`: `S`, `A`, `B`, `C`, `D`, or a comma-separated list such as `S,A`"
msgstr "`rank`：`S`、`A`、`B`、`C`、`D`，或诸如 `S,A` 的逗号分隔列表"

#: manual/getting_started.md:109
msgid "`momentum`: `New`, `Rising`, `Stable`, `Cooling`, or a list such as `Rising,New`"
msgstr "`momentum`：`New`、`Rising`、`Stable`、`Cooling`，或诸如 `Rising,New` 的列表"

#: manual/getting_started.md:112
msgid "`max_age`: days since the latest release"
msgstr "`max_age`：距最新发布的天数"

#: manual/getting_started.md:114
msgid "`has_repository`, `has_license`: `true` or `false`"
msgstr "`has_repository`、`has_license`：`true` 或 `false`"

#: manual/getting_started.md:116
msgid "`order`: `asc` or `desc`"
msgstr "`order`：`asc` 或 `desc`"

#: manual/getting_started.md:117
msgid "`limit`: page size, `50` by default, at most `200`"
msgstr "`limit`：每页大小，默认 `50`，至多 `200`"

#: manual/getting_started.md:118
msgid "`offset`: matches to skip, `0` by default"
msgstr "`offset`：要跳过的匹配数，默认 `0`"

#: manual/getting_started.md:120
msgid "The answer is `{ \"items\": [...], \"total\": n }`, where `total` counts the matches before paging. A request without any criterion lists every package by rank position. Invalid parameters, including a malformed `ast` or `expr`, are answered with HTTP 400 and `{ \"error\": \"<message>\" }`."
msgstr "响应为 `{ \"items\": [...], \"total\": n }`，其中 `total` 是分页之前的匹配数。没有任何条件的请求按名次列出所有包。无效的参数（包括格式错误的 `ast` 或 `expr`）会以 HTTP 400 和 `{ \"error\": \"<message>\" }` 响应。"

