#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "mooncake_impact_factor"
msgstr "mooncake_impact_factor"

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "This manual documents version `v0.2.0` of `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor`."
msgstr "本手册记录 `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor` 的 `v0.2.0` 版本。"

#: manual/index.md:7
msgid "`mooncake_impact_factor` ranks the packages of the MoonBit registry by how much the ecosystem relies on them. It counts the packages whose latest release depends on each package (those of other owners fully, those of the same owner at a quarter), the recent ones among them, downloads and release age; it places every package in the registry by position, grade and 30-day momentum, and lets you search, filter and compare the result in a web application, at <https://impact-factor.lunaflow.cn>, that runs locally against SQLite or as a static site."
msgstr "`mooncake_impact_factor` 按生态对 MoonBit 注册表中各个包的依赖程度为它们排名。它统计最新版本依赖每个包的那些包（其他所有者的完整计数，同一所有者的按四分之一计）、其中的近期依赖方、下载量和发布年龄；它按名次、等级和 30 天势头确定每个包在注册表中的位置，并让你在一个 Web 应用（<https://impact-factor.lunaflow.cn>）中搜索、筛选和比较结果；该应用既可以基于 SQLite 在本地运行，也可以作为静态站点运行。"

#: manual/index.md:16
msgid "The MoonBit module owns the rules: the registry signals live in `metrics`, the score, grades and momentum in `score`, the search query language in `query`, its SQL compilation in `query_sql` and the static site's search engine in `static_search`. The rest of the repository calls them and is not MoonBit: the Python index builder and static exporter in `scripts/`, and the Next.js application in `app/`, `frontend/src/` and `lib/`. The [architecture guide](architecture.md) shows how they fit together."
msgstr "规则归 MoonBit 模块所有：注册表信号在 `metrics` 中，分数、等级和势头在 `score` 中，搜索查询语言在 `query` 中，其 SQL 编译在 `query_sql` 中，静态站点的搜索引擎在 `static_search` 中。仓库的其余部分调用它们，且不是 MoonBit：`scripts/` 中的 Python 索引构建器和静态导出器，以及 `app/`、`frontend/src/` 和 `lib/` 中的 Next.js 应用。[架构指南](architecture.md)展示了它们如何组合在一起。"

#: manual/index.md:25
msgid "Install"
msgstr "安装"

#: manual/index.md:31
msgid "Then import the package you need in your `moon.pkg`, for example `\"Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/score\"`. `score`, `metrics`, `query`, `query_sql` and `static_search` build for every target, and `score` gives the same bits on every backend; `cli` builds only for the JavaScript target. The module needs the MoonBit toolchain 0.10 or later (`moonc` ≥ 0.10). Running `cli` and the web application also needs Node.js 20.16, 22.3 or later, and the index builder needs Python 3."
msgstr "然后在你的 `moon.pkg` 中导入所需的包，例如 `\"Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/score\"`。`score`、`metrics`、`query`、`query_sql` 和 `static_search` 可为所有目标构建，且 `score` 在每个后端上给出逐位相同的结果；`cli` 只能为 JavaScript 目标构建。本模块需要 MoonBit 工具链 0.10 或更高版本（`moonc` ≥ 0.10）。运行 `cli` 和 Web 应用还需要 Node.js 20.16、22.3 或更高版本，索引构建器需要 Python 3。"

