msgstr "cli 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows you how to measure a registry from outside MoonBit with the `build-index` command: write the release records of a few packages to a JSON file, run the command, and read the report with `jq` and from Python, as the index builder does. You need a checkout of this repository, the MoonBit toolchain, Node.js 20.16, 22.3 or later, and `jq` for the shell examples. Run every command from the repository root."
msgstr "本教程介绍如何在 MoonBit 之外用 `build-index` 命令度量一个注册表：把几个包的发布记录写入 JSON 文件，运行命令，然后像索引构建器那样用 `jq` 和 Python 读取报告。你需要本仓库的检出、MoonBit 工具链、Node.js 20.16、22.3 或更高版本，以及用于 shell 示例的 `jq`。所有命令都在仓库根目录下运行。"

