#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:84
msgid "The examples below read the `report.json` of the quick start."
msgstr "下面的示例读取快速开始中的 `report.json`。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:86
msgid "List the ranking"
msgstr "列出排名"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:88
msgid "Every package carries its score snapshot. Sort by `rank_position` to get the ranking:"
msgstr "每个包都带有其分数快照。按 `rank_position` 排序即可得到排名："

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:104
msgid "The labels are shares of the population: with four packages each position is 25 % of it, so position 2 is already `B`. The [score tutorial](score.md#rank-a-population) shows the rule in MoonBit."
msgstr "标签按在总体中所占的比例划分：有四个包时，每个名次占总体的 25 %，因此名次 2 就已经是 `B`。[score 教程](score.md#rank-a-population)用 MoonBit 展示了这一规则。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:108
msgid "Explain one score"
msgstr "解释一个分数"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:110
msgid "`signals` holds what was measured now, `signals_30d_ago` what was measured 30 days earlier, and `snapshot.breakdown` the three terms of the score and the release multiplier:"
msgstr "`signals` 存放现在度量的结果，`signals_30d_ago` 存放 30 天前度量的结果，`snapshot.breakdown` 存放分数的三项和发布乘数："

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:146
msgid "Thirty days ago `bob/web` did not exist yet, so `alice/json` had one external dependent fewer; its downloads came from the snapshot; and its latest release was 0.1.0, 302 days old. The score is $(44.79 + 21.90 + 156.00) \\times 1.12 \\approx 249.4$."
msgstr "30 天前 `bob/web` 还不存在，因此 `alice/json` 少一个外部依赖方；它的下载量取自快照；它的最新发布是 0.1.0，已有 302 天。分数为 $(44.79 + 21.90 + 156.00) \\times 1.12 \\approx 249.4$。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:151
#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:165
msgid "List the dependents of a package"
msgstr "列出一个包的依赖方"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:153
msgid "`edges` holds every current dependency once, with the date it first appeared:"
msgstr "`edges` 中每条当前依赖只出现一次，并带有它首次出现的日期："

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:167
msgid "`carol/cli` added the dependency more than 180 days ago, so it is not one of the recent dependents. `alice/http` has the same owner and counts a quarter in the score."
msgstr "`carol/cli` 在 180 多天前就加入了该依赖，因此它不是近期依赖方之一。`alice/http` 属于同一所有者，在分数中按四分之一计。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:171
msgid "Follow the 30-day change"
msgstr "跟踪 30 天的变化"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:173
msgid "`score_30d_ago` and `momentum_label` show how each package moved:"
msgstr "`score_30d_ago` 和 `momentum_label` 显示每个包的变化："

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:186
msgid "A key whose value is unknown is absent from the report, and `jq` reads an absent key as `null`. `bob/web` had no release 30 days ago, so it has no `signals_30d_ago`, and it is missing from the download snapshot, so it has no `downloads_30d_ago`:"
msgstr "值未知的键不会出现在报告中，而 `jq` 把不存在的键读作 `null`。`bob/web` 在 30 天前没有发布，因此没有 `signals_30d_ago`；它也不在下载量快照中，因此没有 `downloads_30d_ago`："

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:199
msgid "Call it from Python"
msgstr "从 Python 调用"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:201
msgid "The index builder writes the input to a temporary file, runs the command with `--output` and reads the report back. A minimal version:"
msgstr "索引构建器把输入写入一个临时文件，用 `--output` 运行命令，再把报告读回来。一个最简版本："

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:254
msgid "`bob/web` has no release date and no downloads; its dependency on `alice/json` still counts, but not as recent, because its date is unknown. Reading the report from a file rather than from standard output keeps a large report out of the pipe, and the exit status tells success from failure."
msgstr "`bob/web` 没有发布日期，也没有下载量；它对 `alice/json` 的依赖仍然计数，但不算近期，因为其日期未知。从文件而不是标准输出读取报告，可以让大型报告不经过管道，而退出状态可以区分成功和失败。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:260
msgid "Handle errors"
msgstr "处理错误"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:262
msgid "Errors print a JSON object with an `error` key and exit with status `1`. A date without a time and a zone is not RFC 3339:"
msgstr "错误会输出一个带 `error` 键的 JSON 对象，并以状态 `1` 退出。只有日期、没有时间和时区的值不是 RFC 3339："

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:275
msgid "An unknown release date written as `null` instead of an absent key:"
msgstr "未知的发布日期写成了 `null`，而不是省略该键："

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:291
msgid "An input path that does not exist, or cannot be read, prints a JSON error and exits with status `1`:"
msgstr "输入路径不存在或无法读取时，会打印 JSON 错误并以状态 1 退出："

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:303
msgid "Check the exit status before you use the output. An output path that cannot be written is still reported by Node.js and may print a stack trace to standard error."
msgstr "使用输出前请检查退出状态。无法写入的输出路径仍由 Node.js 报告，并可能向标准错误打印堆栈跟踪。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:307
#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:391
#: manual/tutorial/score.md:295
msgid "Going further"
msgstr "进阶"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:309
msgid "**Measure the real registry.** `python3 scripts/build_index.py` reads the local registry index under `~/.moon/registry/index/user`, fetches the download counts, keeps a 45-day download history in `data/download_history.json`, runs `build-index` once and writes the report to the SQLite database of the web application. `--now` fixes the point in time; the [architecture guide](../architecture.md) describes the whole pipeline."
msgstr "**度量真实的注册表。** `python3 scripts/build_index.py` 读取 `~/.moon/registry/index/user` 下的本地注册表索引，获取下载量，在 `data/download_history.json` 中保留 45 天的下载量历史，运行一次 `build-index`，并把报告写入 Web 应用的 SQLite 数据库。`--now` 固定时间点；[架构指南](../architecture.md)描述了完整的管道。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:316
msgid "**Work in MoonBit instead.** Inside a MoonBit program, call `@metrics.compute` directly, as in the [metrics tutorial](metrics.md); the command adds only file reading and JSON."
msgstr "**改在 MoonBit 中处理。** 在 MoonBit 程序内部，直接调用 `@metrics.compute`，如 [metrics 教程](metrics.md)所示；该命令只是额外加上了文件读取和 JSON。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:319
msgid "**Exact rules.** The [metrics API](../api/metrics.md#compute) lists every counting rule; the [cli API](../api/cli.md) lists the input and output contract."
msgstr "**精确规则。** [metrics API](../api/metrics.md#compute) 列出了每条计数规则；[cli API](../api/cli.md) 列出了输入和输出约定。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:323
#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:408
#: manual/tutorial/score.md:315
msgid "Common pitfalls"
msgstr "常见陷阱"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:325
msgid "**`null` for unknown values.** Leave the key out. Only `created_at` is optional in the input; every other key is required."
msgstr "**用 `null` 表示未知值。** 应省略该键。输入中只有 `created_at` 是可选的；其他每个键都是必填的。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:327
msgid "**Wrong argument order.** `build-index` must be the first argument after the script; `--input input.json build-index` prints the usage error."
msgstr "**参数顺序错误。** `build-index` 必须是脚本之后的第一个参数；`--input input.json build-index` 会输出用法错误。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:329
msgid "**Stale build.** Rebuild after you change `src/score` or `src/metrics`, or the report follows the old rules. The index builder rebuilds before every run; a hand-run `node` command does not."
msgstr "**构建过期。** 修改 `src/score` 或 `src/metrics` 之后要重新构建，否则报告仍按旧规则计算。索引构建器每次运行前都会重新构建；手动运行的 `node` 命令则不会。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:332
msgid "**Reading standard output with `--output`.** With `--output` the command prints nothing on success; read the file."
msgstr "**带 `--output` 时读取标准输出。** 带 `--output` 时，命令成功后什么也不打印；请读取文件。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:334
msgid "**Comparing reports from different inputs.** Ranks are shares of the population in the input. A report built from a few packages ranks them among themselves, not against the registry."
msgstr "**比较来自不同输入的报告。** 等级是在输入总体中所占的比例。由少数几个包构建的报告只在它们之间排名，而不是与整个注册表比较。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:338
#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:423
#: manual/tutorial/score.md:333
#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:178
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "下一步"

