#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:1
msgid "metrics tutorial"
msgstr "metrics 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows you how to measure a small registry with the `metrics` package: write a few release records, compute the report, and read the dependents, signals, scores and dependency edges it contains. It then adds the details that real registries have: yanked releases, dropped dependencies, a download history and JSON written by another program. You need the MoonBit toolchain; the [score tutorial](score.md) explains the scores and labels that the report contains. The [metrics design](../design/metrics.md) explains why the rules are what they are."
msgstr "本教程介绍如何用 `metrics` 包度量一个小型注册表：写出几条发布记录，计算报告，并读取其中的依赖方、信号、分数和依赖边。然后加入真实注册表所具有的细节：撤回的发布、被移除的依赖、下载量历史，以及由另一个程序写出的 JSON。你需要 MoonBit 工具链；[score 教程](score.md)解释了报告中所含的分数和标签。[metrics 设计](../design/metrics.md)解释了这些规则为何如此。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:16
msgid "find one package in the report"
msgstr "在报告中查找一个包"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:16
msgid "`report.packages`, ordered by name"
msgstr "`report.packages`，按名称排序"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:17
msgid "`report.edges` with `target` equal to its name"
msgstr "`target` 等于其名称的 `report.edges`"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:18
msgid "compare with 30 days ago"
msgstr "与 30 天前比较"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:18
msgid "`package.signals_30d_ago` and `package.snapshot`"
msgstr "`package.signals_30d_ago` 和 `package.snapshot`"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:19
msgid "use download growth"
msgstr "使用下载量增长"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:19
msgid "`input.download_history` with a snapshot near 30 days ago"
msgstr "带有一个接近 30 天前的快照的 `input.download_history`"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:20
msgid "read input written by another tool"
msgstr "读取由另一个工具写出的输入"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:24
#: manual/tutorial/score.md:22
msgid "Add the module to your project:"
msgstr "把模块添加到你的项目："

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:30
msgid "Import the packages in the `moon.pkg` of the package that uses them:"
msgstr "在使用这些包的那个包的 `moon.pkg` 中导入它们："

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:40
msgid "Measure a registry of two packages, where `bob/web` depends on `alice/json`:"
msgstr "度量一个由两个包组成的注册表，其中 `bob/web` 依赖 `alice/json`："

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:81
msgid "The report lists the packages in name order. `alice/json` has one dependent and ranks first; `bob/web` has none."
msgstr "报告按名称顺序列出各包。`alice/json` 有一个依赖方，排名第一；`bob/web` 没有依赖方。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:84
msgid "`compute` raises an error only when `now` is not a valid timestamp, so the test calls it without a handler; in a function, mark the caller with `raise` or handle the error, as shown [below](#handle-an-invalid-now)."
msgstr "`compute` 只在 `now` 不是合法时间戳时抛出错误，因此测试中不带处理器直接调用它；在函数中，要把调用方标记为 `raise`，或者处理该错误，如[下文](#handle-an-invalid-now)所示。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:90
msgid "The examples below write release records with a small helper and look packages up by name. Copy both next to your tests:"
msgstr "下面的示例用一个小辅助函数写出发布记录，并按名称查找包。把两者都复制到你的测试旁边："

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:112
msgid "Read a package report"
msgstr "读取包报告"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:114
msgid "A `PackageReport` carries the counts, the signals that entered the score and the score snapshot:"
msgstr "`PackageReport` 带有各个计数、计入分数的信号以及分数快照："

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:160
msgid "`alice/http` belongs to the same owner, so it is a same-owner dependent and counts a quarter in the score. `bob/web` and `alice/http` first declared the dependency within the last 180 days, so both are recent; `carol/cli` did so in 2025. `dependent_owners` counts the other owners only."
msgstr "`alice/http` 属于同一所有者，因此它是同一所有者的依赖方，在分数中按四分之一计。`bob/web` 和 `alice/http` 都是在最近 180 天内首次声明该依赖的，因此两者都是近期的；`carol/cli` 是在 2025 年声明的。`dependent_owners` 只统计其他所有者。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:167
msgid "`report.edges` holds every current dependency once. Filter it by target to list the dependents of a package, with the date each dependency first appeared:"
msgstr "`report.edges` 中每条当前依赖只出现一次。按目标过滤它，即可列出一个包的依赖方，以及每个依赖首次出现的日期："

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:200
msgid "Dates in edges are normalised to UTC with milliseconds by `@metrics.format_timestamp`."
msgstr "边中的日期由 `@metrics.format_timestamp` 规范化为带毫秒的 UTC。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:203
msgid "Follow dependency changes"
msgstr "跟踪依赖的变化"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:205
msgid "Only the latest release of each dependent counts, and yanked releases are skipped. A package that dropped a dependency is no longer a dependent:"
msgstr "只有每个依赖方的最新发布才计入，撤回的发布会被跳过。移除了某个依赖的包不再是依赖方："

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:247
msgid "`versions` lists every release, yanked ones included, newest first; `latest_version` skips the yanked release."
msgstr "`versions` 列出每个发布版本（包括撤回的），最新的在前；`latest_version` 会跳过撤回的发布。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:250
msgid "Compare with 30 days ago"
msgstr "与 30 天前比较"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:252
msgid "The report computes every signal a second time as of 30 days before `now`, from the releases published by then. A package without a release then has no earlier signals and is `New`:"
msgstr "报告会按 `now` 之前 30 天的状态，根据截至当时已发布的版本，再计算一次每个信号。当时还没有发布的包没有较早的信号，势头为 `New`："

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:286
msgid "`a/lib` went from one dependent to three in 30 days and is `Rising`. `c/app` and `d/app` did not exist on 1 September and are `New`."
msgstr "`a/lib` 在 30 天内从一个依赖方增加到三个，势头为 `Rising`。`c/app` 和 `d/app` 在 9 月 1 日还不存在，势头为 `New`。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:289
msgid "Use a download history"
msgstr "使用下载量历史"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:291
msgid "Download counts only grow, so the report needs an earlier count to see download growth. Pass the snapshots you kept in `download_history`; the one nearest to 30 days ago, at most 7 days away, is used. Without one, the current count stands in for the earlier count and downloads add no growth:"
msgstr "下载量只会增长，因此报告需要一个较早的计数才能看出下载量增长。把你保存的快照传入 `download_history`；其中最接近 30 天前、且相差至多 7 天的那个会被使用。没有这样的快照时，用当前计数代替较早的计数，下载量不带来任何增长："

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:323
msgid "The snapshot of 10 August is 22 days away from 1 September and is ignored; the one of 3 September is used."
msgstr "8 月 10 日的快照与 9 月 1 日相差 22 天，会被忽略；使用的是 9 月 3 日的快照。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:326
msgid "Read input written by another tool"
msgstr "读取由另一个工具写出的输入"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:328
msgid "The [`build-index` command](cli.md) reads the input as JSON. The same text decodes in MoonBit with `@json.parse` and `@json.from_json`. A `None` field is an absent key; JSON `null` is rejected:"
msgstr "[`build-index` 命令](cli.md)以 JSON 读取输入。同样的文本在 MoonBit 中可以用 `@json.parse` 和 `@json.from_json` 解码。`None` 字段表示为不出现的键；JSON `null` 会被拒绝："

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:359
msgid "`a/lib` has no `created_at`, so its release is undated: its age is `@score.UNKNOWN_RELEASE_AGE_DAYS`, which gives the lowest multiplier."
msgstr "`a/lib` 没有 `created_at`，因此它的发布没有日期：它的发布年龄为 `@score.UNKNOWN_RELEASE_AGE_DAYS`，得到最低的乘数。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:362
msgid "Handle an invalid `now`"
msgstr "处理无效的 `now`"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:364
msgid "`compute` raises `InvalidNow` when `now` does not parse. Release dates that do not parse are not errors; they make the release undated."
msgstr "`now` 无法解析时，`compute` 抛出 `InvalidNow`。无法解析的发布日期不是错误；它们只会让该发布没有日期。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:388
msgid "A date without a time and a zone is not RFC 3339, so `\"2026-10-01\"` is rejected."
msgstr "只有日期、没有时间和时区的值不是 RFC 3339，因此 `\"2026-10-01\"` 会被拒绝。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:393
msgid "**Measure the whole registry at once.** Ranks are shares of the population that `compute` sees, so measuring a subset gives different labels. The [`build-index` command](cli.md) passes every release of the local registry in one input."
msgstr "**一次度量整个注册表。** 等级是在 `compute` 所见总体中所占的比例，因此只度量一个子集会得到不同的标签。[`build-index` 命令](cli.md)把本地注册表的所有发布版本放在一个输入中传入。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:398
msgid "**Keep download snapshots.** The registry records releases with dates, so the past dependents can be recomputed at any time, but download counts are only known when someone fetches them. Store a snapshot of the counts every day for at least 37 days, so that one always lies within 7 days of the 30-days-ago point. The index builder keeps 45 days."
msgstr "**保留下载量快照。** 注册表记录了带日期的发布，因此过去的依赖方随时可以重新计算，但下载量只有在有人获取时才能知道。每天保存一份计数快照，至少保存 37 天，这样总有一个快照与“30 天前”这一时间点相差不超过 7 天。索引构建器保留 45 天。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:404
msgid "**Store the report.** `Report` converts to JSON with `Json(report)`; the [cli API](../api/cli.md) documents the JSON form that the index builder stores."
msgstr "**保存报告。** `Report` 可以用 `Json(report)` 转换为 JSON；[cli API](../api/cli.md) 记录了索引构建器所保存的 JSON 形式。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:410
msgid "**`null` for unknown dates.** Write no `created_at` key at all; `null` fails to decode."
msgstr "**用 `null` 表示未知日期。** 应该完全不写 `created_at` 键；`null` 会解码失败。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:412
msgid "**Dates without a zone.** `2026-09-30T15:52:04` has no zone and does not parse. As `now` it raises `InvalidNow`; as a release date it makes the release undated, which ranks it below every dated release of its package."
msgstr "**不带时区的日期。** `2026-09-30T15:52:04` 没有时区，无法解析。作为 `now` 时它会抛出 `InvalidNow`；作为发布日期时它会让该发布没有日期，从而排在同一包所有有日期的发布之后。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:415
msgid "**Releases in the future.** Releases dated after `now` are ignored, but they still count in `version_count` and `versions`."
msgstr "**未来的发布。** 日期晚于 `now` 的发布会被忽略，但它们仍会计入 `version_count` 和 `versions`。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:417
msgid "**Names with different case.** `Alice/json` and `alice/json` are different packages with different owners."
msgstr "**大小写不同的名称。** `Alice/json` 和 `alice/json` 是不同的包，属于不同的所有者。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:419
msgid "**Earlier counts above the current count.** An earlier download count is capped at the current one, so a count that went down adds no download change rather than a loss."
msgstr "**较早的计数高于当前计数。** 较早的下载量以当前计数为上限，因此下降了的计数不会带来下载量变化，而不是带来损失。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:425
msgid "[metrics API](../api/metrics.md) for every type, field and rule."
msgstr "[metrics API](../api/metrics.md)：每个类型、字段和规则。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:426
msgid "[metrics design](../design/metrics.md) for the reasons behind the counting rules."
msgstr "[metrics 设计](../design/metrics.md)：计数规则背后的理由。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:428
msgid "[score tutorial](score.md) to work with the scores and labels directly."
msgstr "[score 教程](score.md)：直接使用分数和标签。"

#: manual/tutorial/metrics.md:429
msgid "[cli tutorial](cli.md) to run the computation on a JSON file."
msgstr "[cli 教程](cli.md)：在 JSON 文件上运行这一计算。"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:1
msgid "query tutorial"
msgstr "query 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows you how to write search queries for the web application, and how to parse, inspect and rewrite them from MoonBit with the `query` package. The [query design](../design/query.md) explains the grammar; the [query API](../api/query.md) lists every function."
msgstr "本教程介绍如何为 Web 应用编写搜索查询，以及如何用 `query` 包在 MoonBit 中解析、检查和改写它们。[query 设计](../design/query.md)解释了语法；[query API](../api/query.md) 列出了每个函数。"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:10
msgid "search the web application"
msgstr "在 Web 应用中搜索"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:10
msgid "an expression such as `json AND score>=180` in the search box or the advanced dialog"
msgstr "在搜索框或高级对话框中输入诸如 `json AND score>=180` 的表达式"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:11
msgid "parse an expression"
msgstr "解析一个表达式"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:12
