msgstr "把 URL 参数转换为查询"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:15
msgid "check a rank or momentum value"
msgstr "检查等级或势头值"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:17
msgid "Writing queries"
msgstr "编写查询"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:19
msgid "You do not need MoonBit to use the language: type it in the search box of the advanced dialog, or pass it as the `expr` URL parameter."
msgstr "使用这门语言不需要 MoonBit：在高级对话框的搜索框中输入它，或者把它作为 `expr` URL 参数传入。"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:22
#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:84
