msgstr "该短语，包括其中的空格"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:26
msgid "packages of the owner `gmlewis`"
msgstr "所有者 `gmlewis` 的包"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:27
msgid "either keyword"
msgstr "两个关键词之一"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:28
msgid "`json` packages except rank `D`"
msgstr "除等级 `D` 以外的 `json` 包"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:29
msgid "grouping with parentheses"
msgstr "用括号分组"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:30
msgid "rising packages released in the last 30 days"
msgstr "最近 30 天内发布的上升中的包"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:31
msgid "the ten best-ranked packages"
msgstr "名次最好的十个包"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:32
msgid "packages used outside their owner's namespace"
msgstr "在所有者自己的命名空间之外被使用的包"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:34
msgid "Three rules cover most surprises:"
msgstr "三条规则涵盖了大多数意外情况："

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:36
msgid "`NOT` binds tightest, then `AND`, then `OR`: `NOT a OR b AND c` means `(NOT a) OR (b AND c)`. Use parentheses when in doubt."
msgstr "`NOT` 结合最紧，其次是 `AND`，然后是 `OR`：`NOT a OR b AND c` 表示 `(NOT a) OR (b AND c)`。拿不准时请使用括号。"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:38
msgid "Field names are lower case and exact (`owner:`, not `Owner:`); `AND`, `OR` and `NOT` can be written in any case."
msgstr "字段名是小写的且必须精确匹配（是 `owner:`，而不是 `Owner:`）；`AND`、`OR` 和 `NOT` 可以用任意大小写书写。"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:40
msgid "Quote values that contain spaces, colons or other punctuation: `repository:\"https://github.com/x\"`."
msgstr "对包含空格、冒号或其他标点的值加上引号：`repository:\"https://github.com/x\"`。"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:43
msgid "The fields are listed in the [API](../api/query.md#field). Rank labels are `S A B C D`, momentum labels `New Rising Stable Cooling`, both matched ignoring case."
msgstr "各字段列在 [API](../api/query.md#field) 中。等级标签为 `S A B C D`，势头标签为 `New Rising Stable Cooling`，两者都忽略大小写进行匹配。"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:47
msgid "Quick start in MoonBit"
msgstr "在 MoonBit 中快速开始"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:49
msgid "Add the module and import the package:"
msgstr "添加模块并导入该包："

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:61
msgid "Parse an expression and look at the tree:"
msgstr "解析一个表达式并查看其树："

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:77
msgid "It prints `text : json negated=false` and `rank = D negated=true`. The package builds for every target, so `moon test --target all` runs it on each backend."
msgstr "它打印 `text : json negated=false` 和 `rank = D negated=true`。该包可为所有目标构建，因此 `moon test --target all` 会在每个后端上运行它。"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:83
msgid "Report a syntax error"
msgstr "报告语法错误"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:85
