msgstr "在代码中构建查询并打印它"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:120
msgid "Accept the parameters of the web interface"
msgstr "接受 Web 界面的参数"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:122
msgid "`derive_ast` turns a map of web interface parameters into a tree: `ast` first, then `expr`, then the flat fields."
msgstr "`derive_ast` 把由 Web 界面参数组成的映射转换为一棵树：先看 `ast`，再看 `expr`，最后是扁平字段。"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:139
msgid "An unknown label raises `QueryError(\"momentum must be one of New, Rising, Stable, Cooling\")`."
msgstr "未知标签会抛出 `QueryError(\"momentum must be one of New, Rising, Stable, Cooling\")`。"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:142
msgid "Store a query"
msgstr "保存查询"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:144
msgid "`encode` gives the JSON text the web interface puts in the `ast` URL parameter, and `decode` reads it back, validating it:"
msgstr "`encode` 给出 Web 界面放在 `ast` URL 参数中的 JSON 文本，`decode` 把它读回来并进行验证："

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:155
#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:91
#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:164
msgid "Pitfalls"
msgstr "陷阱"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:157
msgid "**Blank queries match everything.** `has_intent` is false for a tree whose values are all blank, and the searches then list every package."
msgstr "**空白查询匹配一切。** 对于所有值都是空白的树，`has_intent` 为假，此时搜索会列出每个包。"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:159
msgid "**Empty groups.** The query builder can create an empty group; it is written `()`, which the parser does not accept. Remove empty groups before showing the expression to users."
msgstr "**空组。** 查询构建器可以创建空组；它被写成 `()`，而解析器不接受这种写法。在把表达式显示给用户之前，请先移除空组。"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:162
msgid "**Values are not checked per field.** `score>=abc` parses. The database search answers it with HTTP 400; the static search matches nothing."
msgstr "**值不按字段检查。** `score>=abc` 可以解析。数据库搜索会以 HTTP 400 回应它；静态搜索则什么也不匹配。"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:167
msgid "[query API](../api/query.md) for every function and the JSON form."
msgstr "[query API](../api/query.md)：每个函数和 JSON 形式。"

#: manual/tutorial/query.md:168
msgid "[query design](../design/query.md) for the grammar and the round-trip argument."
msgstr "[query 设计](../design/query.md)：语法和往返论证。"

