msgstr "[query_sql 教程](query_sql.md)和 [static_search 教程](static_search.md)：两种搜索模式如何回答查询。"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:1
msgid "query_sql tutorial"
msgstr "query_sql 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows you how the dynamic site turns a search request into SQL, and how to use the `query_sql` package to compile queries yourself. The [query_sql design](../design/query_sql.md) explains the two compilation paths; the [query_sql API](../api/query_sql.md) lists every function."
msgstr "本教程介绍动态站点如何把搜索请求转换成 SQL，以及如何用 `query_sql` 包自己编译查询。[query_sql 设计](../design/query_sql.md)解释了两条编译路径；[query_sql API](../api/query_sql.md) 列出了每个函数。"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:10
msgid "search the running site"
msgstr "搜索运行中的站点"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:10
msgid "`GET /api/search?...` (see [getting started](../getting_started.md#3-query-the-apis))"
msgstr "`GET /api/search?...`（见[入门](../getting_started.md#3-query-the-apis)）"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:11
msgid "compile a query tree to a `WHERE` clause"
msgstr "把查询树编译为 `WHERE` 子句"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:12
msgid "compile the free-text `q` syntax"
msgstr "编译自由文本 `q` 语法"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:13
msgid "plan a whole request"
msgstr "规划一个完整的请求"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:17
msgid "Import both packages:"
msgstr "导入两个包："

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:26
msgid "Compile an expression:"
msgstr "编译一个表达式："

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:39
msgid "`fragment.sql` has one `?` per value. Put it after `WHERE` in a query over `packages p JOIN package_scores s ON s.package_id = p.id` and bind the values in order."
msgstr "`fragment.sql` 中每个值对应一个 `?`。把它放在针对 `packages p JOIN package_scores s ON s.package_id = p.id` 的查询中的 `WHERE` 之后，并按顺序绑定这些值。"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:45
msgid "Plan a request like the server"
msgstr "像服务器那样规划请求"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:47
msgid "`plan_search` takes the URL parameters of `/api/search` and returns all parts of the statement:"
msgstr "`plan_search` 接收 `/api/search` 的 URL 参数，并返回语句的所有部分："

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:69
msgid "`lib/data.ts` does exactly this and runs a second statement, `SELECT COUNT(*) FROM <from> WHERE <where>`, for the total."
msgstr "`lib/data.ts` 正是这样做的，并为求总数再运行一条语句 `SELECT COUNT(*) FROM <from> WHERE <where>`。"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:72
msgid "Turn errors into messages"
msgstr "把错误转换为消息"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:74
msgid "Every problem is a `SqlError` with a message meant for the user:"
msgstr "每个问题都是一个带有面向用户消息的 `SqlError`："

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:93
msgid "**`q` needs operators.** `json parser` is an error; write `json AND parser` or the phrase `\"json parser\"`."
msgstr "**`q` 需要运算符。** `json parser` 是错误；请写 `json AND parser` 或短语 `\"json parser\"`。"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:95
msgid "**Text terms are prefix matches**, not substrings: `json` finds `json5` but not `fastjson`. The static site uses substrings."
msgstr "**文本项是前缀匹配**，而不是子串匹配：`json` 能找到 `json5`，但找不到 `fastjson`。静态站点使用子串匹配。"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:97
msgid "**Columns of scoring v2.** `external_dependents`, `owners`, `age` and `position` need the `external_dependent_count`, `dependent_owner_count`, `days_since_release` and `rank_position` columns written by the index builder."
msgstr "**评分 v2 的列。** `external_dependents`、`owners`、`age` 和 `position` 需要索引构建器写入的 `external_dependent_count`、`dependent_owner_count`、`days_since_release` 和 `rank_position` 列。"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:104
#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:184
