msgstr "[query 教程](query.md)：表达式语言。"

#: manual/tutorial/query_sql.md:105
msgid "[query_sql design](../design/query_sql.md) for why the flat parameters are not compiled through a query tree."
msgstr "[query_sql 设计](../design/query_sql.md)：为何扁平参数不经过查询树编译。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:1
msgid "score tutorial"
msgstr "score 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows you how to score MoonBit packages with the `score` package: describe a package by its signals, compute and explain its score, rank a small population, and read the momentum labels that compare a package with itself 30 days earlier. You need the MoonBit toolchain and a project to add the dependency to. The [score design](../design/score.md) explains why the formula and the labels are what they are; this page only uses them."
msgstr "本教程介绍如何用 `score` 包为 MoonBit 包评分：用信号描述一个包，计算并解释它的分数，为一个小总体排名，并读取把一个包与它自己 30 天前相比较的势头标签。你需要 MoonBit 工具链，以及一个可以添加该依赖的项目。[score 设计](../design/score.md)解释了公式和标签为何如此；本页只是使用它们。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:13
msgid "score one package"
msgstr "为一个包评分"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:14
msgid "see where a score comes from"
msgstr "查看分数从何而来"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:15
msgid "rank and label a population"
msgstr "为一个总体排名并加标签"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:16
msgid "rank scores computed elsewhere"
msgstr "为在别处计算的分数排名"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:16
msgid "`@score.rank_positions(scores)` and `@score.rank_label(position, population, score)`"
msgstr "`@score.rank_positions(scores)` 和 `@score.rank_label(position, population, score)`"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:17
msgid "label a 30-day change"
msgstr "为 30 天的变化加标签"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:18
msgid "count signals from release records"
msgstr "从发布记录统计信号"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:18
msgid "the [`metrics` package](metrics.md)"
msgstr "[`metrics` 包](metrics.md)"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:28
msgid "Import the package in the `moon.pkg` of the package that uses it. The JSON examples below also need `moonbitlang/core/json`:"
msgstr "在使用它的包的 `moon.pkg` 中导入该包。下面的 JSON 示例还需要 `moonbitlang/core/json`："

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:38
msgid "Describe a package that 12 packages of other owners and 4 packages of its own owner depend on, 3 of the external ones added in the last 180 days, with 850 downloads and a release 45 days ago, and score it:"
msgstr "描述一个包：其他所有者的 12 个包和它自己所有者的 4 个包依赖它，其中 3 个外部依赖方是在最近 180 天内加入的，下载量为 850，最近一次发布在 45 天前；然后为它评分："

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:56
msgid "The score is a plain `Double` that grows with every signal. On its own it says little; it becomes useful when you compare packages, which the following sections do."
msgstr "分数是一个随每个信号增长的普通 `Double`。单独看它说明不了什么；只有在比较包时它才有用，后面各节正是这样做的。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:62
msgid "The examples below build signals with a small helper, so that each example names only the signals it cares about. Copy it next to your tests:"
msgstr "下面的示例用一个小辅助函数构造信号，这样每个示例只需列出它关心的信号。把它复制到你的测试旁边："

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:85
msgid "Explain where a score comes from"
msgstr "解释分数的来源"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:87
msgid "`score_breakdown` returns the three weighted terms and the release multiplier. The score is the sum of the terms times the multiplier:"
msgstr "`score_breakdown` 返回三个加权项和发布乘数。分数等于各项之和乘以乘数："

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:110
msgid "The equality is exact: `compute_score` evaluates the same expression. Each term is a weight times $\\ln(1 + n)$, so doubling a count adds far less than double the points."
msgstr "这个等式是精确的：`compute_score` 计算的正是同一个表达式。每一项都是权重乘以 $\\ln(1 + n)$，因此把一个计数翻倍所增加的分数远不到原来的两倍。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:114
msgid "Compare external and same-owner dependents"
msgstr "比较外部依赖方与同一所有者的依赖方"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:116
msgid "A dependent of the same owner counts a quarter (`SELF_DEPENDENT_WEIGHT`). Eight packages of the author's own weigh as much as two packages of other owners:"
msgstr "同一所有者的依赖方按四分之一计（`SELF_DEPENDENT_WEIGHT`）。作者自己的八个包与其他所有者的两个包权重相同："

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:129
msgid "See the effect of release age"
msgstr "查看发布年龄的影响"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:131
msgid "`activity_multiplier` scales the whole score from 1.12 for a release at most 30 days old down to 0.88 for one a year old or older, in a straight line in between:"
msgstr "`activity_multiplier` 对整个分数进行缩放：发布不超过 30 天时为 1.12，发布满一年或更久时降到 0.88，两者之间呈直线变化："

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:155
msgid "The same signals lose about a fifth of their score over the first year without a release, and nothing after that."
msgstr "同样的信号在没有新发布的第一年里会损失约五分之一的分数，此后不再损失。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:158
msgid "Rank a population"
msgstr "为一个总体排名"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:160
msgid "Rank labels are relative: `S` is the best 5 % of a population, `A` the next 10 %, `B` the next 20 %, `C` the next 30 % and `D` the rest. Score a population with `score_population`. Its second argument holds the signals 30 days ago; pass `None` when you do not have them, which marks every package as `New`:"
msgstr "等级标签是相对的：`S` 是总体中最好的 5 %，`A` 是接下来的 10 %，`B` 是再接下来的 20 %，`C` 是再接下来的 30 %，`D` 是其余部分。用 `score_population` 为一个总体评分。它的第二个参数存放 30 天前的信号；没有这些信号时传入 `None`，这会把每个包都标为 `New`："

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:195
msgid "`bob/http` and `carol/csv` have the same signals, so they share position 2 and the next position is 4. `erin/demo` has no signal at all and is `D` whatever its position. With only five packages, one package is already 20 % of the population: only the first can be `S`, and none is `A`, because the second position already has 20 % of the population above it."
msgstr "`bob/http` 和 `carol/csv` 的信号相同，因此它们共享名次 2，下一个名次是 4。`erin/demo` 完全没有信号，无论名次如何都是 `D`。只有五个包时，一个包就已经占总体的 20 %：只有第一个包能是 `S`，而且没有包是 `A`，因为名次 2 之上已经有总体的 20 %。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:201
msgid "Measure momentum over 30 days"
msgstr "衡量 30 天内的势头"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:203
msgid "Pass the signals as they were 30 days ago to get the change and the momentum label. A package needs to gain at least 10 points and at least 10 % of its earlier score to be `Rising`, and to lose as much to be `Cooling`:"
msgstr "传入 30 天前的信号，即可得到变化量和势头标签。一个包需要增加至少 10 分且至少为原分数的 10 % 才算 `Rising`，减少同样多才算 `Cooling`："

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:238
msgid "The first package gained dependents, downloads and a fresh release. The second changed by a few points only. The third lost two dependents and aged. The fourth had no release 30 days ago, so its earlier score is reported as `0` and its label is `New`."
msgstr "第一个包获得了依赖方、下载量和一次新发布。第二个包只变化了几分。第三个包失去了两个依赖方，并且变旧了。第四个包在 30 天前还没有发布，因此它的原分数报告为 `0`，标签为 `New`。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:243
msgid "Label scores you computed elsewhere"
msgstr "为在别处计算的分数加标签"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:245
msgid "`rank_positions` and `rank_label` work on any list of scores, for example scores read back from a database:"
msgstr "`rank_positions` 和 `rank_label` 适用于任何分数列表，例如从数据库中读回的分数："

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:265
msgid "With ten packages each position is 10 % of the population: position 1 is `S`, position 2 `A`, positions 3 and 4 `B`, positions 5 to 7 `C` (here 5 and the tied 6) and the rest `D`. The score `0.0` is `D` in any case."
msgstr "有十个包时，每个名次占总体的 10 %：名次 1 是 `S`，名次 2 是 `A`，名次 3 和 4 是 `B`，名次 5 到 7 是 `C`（这里是 5 和并列的 6），其余是 `D`。分数 `0.0` 在任何情况下都是 `D`。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:269
msgid "Store snapshots as JSON"
msgstr "以 JSON 保存快照"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:271
msgid "`ScoreSnapshot` converts to JSON with `Json(...)` and back with `@json.from_json`. The `snapshot` object of the [`build-index` report](cli.md) is this form:"
msgstr "`ScoreSnapshot` 用 `Json(...)` 转换为 JSON，再用 `@json.from_json` 转换回来。[`build-index` 报告](cli.md)中的 `snapshot` 对象就是这种形式："

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:292
msgid "`ScoreSnapshot` has no `Eq` implementation, so the check compares the JSON forms."
msgstr "`ScoreSnapshot` 没有实现 `Eq`，所以检查比较的是 JSON 形式。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:297
msgid "**Count signals the way the published scores do.** The functions accept any integers, but the scores of the web application come from fixed rules: the dependents of a package are the packages whose latest non-yanked release depends on it, a dependent is recent when the dependency first appeared in the last 180 days, and the signals 30 days ago are counted from the releases published by then. The [`metrics` package](metrics.md) applies these rules to a list of release records; its [tutorial](metrics.md) builds a report from a few releases."
msgstr "**按已发布分数的方式统计信号。** 这些函数接受任意整数，但 Web 应用中的分数来自固定的规则：一个包的依赖方是最新未撤回版本依赖它的那些包；依赖关系在最近 180 天内首次出现的依赖方是近期的；30 天前的信号根据截至当时已发布的版本统计。[`metrics` 包](metrics.md)把这些规则应用于发布记录列表；它的[教程](metrics.md)从几个发布版本构建一份报告。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:306
msgid "**Keep the population whole.** Positions and labels depend on every package you pass. Scoring a filtered list, such as one owner's packages, gives different labels from scoring the whole registry. Score the whole population once and filter the snapshots afterwards."
msgstr "**保持总体完整。** 名次和标签依赖于你传入的每一个包。为一个经过筛选的列表（例如某个所有者的包）评分，得到的标签与为整个注册表评分不同。请对整个总体评分一次，之后再筛选快照。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:311
msgid "**Compare scores, not labels, across time.** A label can change because other packages moved. The momentum label compares a package's own score with its score 30 days ago and does not depend on the population."
msgstr "**跨时间比较分数，而不是标签。** 标签可能因为其他包的变化而改变。势头标签把一个包自己的分数与它 30 天前的分数比较，不依赖于总体。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:317
msgid "**Swapped fields.** All signals are `Int`, so the compiler cannot tell `downloads` from `external_dependents`. Name the fields in struct literals or helper functions, as above."
msgstr "**字段错位。** 所有信号都是 `Int`，因此编译器无法区分 `downloads` 和 `external_dependents`。请像上面那样，在结构体字面量或辅助函数中写出字段名。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:320
msgid "**Days, not dates.** `days_since_release` is a count of whole days, not a timestamp. A negative value counts as `0` and gets the highest multiplier. Use `UNKNOWN_RELEASE_AGE_DAYS` when the release date is unknown."
msgstr "**天数而非日期。** `days_since_release` 是整天数，而不是时间戳。负值按 `0` 处理，并获得最高乘数。发布日期未知时请使用 `UNKNOWN_RELEASE_AGE_DAYS`。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:323
msgid "**Missing past signals mean `New`.** `None` in `past`, or a `past` array shorter than `current`, makes the package `New` with an earlier score of `0`. Pass the earlier signals whenever the package existed then."
msgstr "**缺少过去的信号意味着 `New`。** `past` 中的 `None`，或比 `current` 短的 `past` 数组，会使该包成为原分数为 `0` 的 `New`。只要该包当时已经存在，就请传入较早的信号。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:326
msgid "**Growth ratio of new packages.** A `score_growth_ratio_30d` of `1` can mean \"doubled\" or \"appeared from nothing\". Check `score_30d_ago == 0.0` to tell them apart."
msgstr "**新包的增长率。** `score_growth_ratio_30d` 为 `1` 可能表示“翻倍”，也可能表示“从无到有”。检查 `score_30d_ago == 0.0` 来区分二者。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:329
msgid "**Positions from another population.** `rank_label` trusts the position and the population you pass. Use positions computed by `rank_positions` over the same list."
msgstr "**来自另一个总体的名次。** `rank_label` 信任你传入的名次和总体规模。请使用 `rank_positions` 在同一列表上计算出的名次。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:335
msgid "[score API](../api/score.md) for every function, constant and edge case."
msgstr "[score API](../api/score.md)：所有函数、常量和边界情况。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:336
msgid "[score design](../design/score.md) for the reasons behind the formula, the weights and the thresholds."
msgstr "[score 设计](../design/score.md)：公式、权重和阈值背后的理由。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:338
msgid "[metrics tutorial](metrics.md) to count signals from release records."
msgstr "[metrics 教程](metrics.md)：从发布记录统计信号。"

#: manual/tutorial/score.md:339
msgid "[cli tutorial](cli.md) to build a report for the whole registry from a JSON file."
msgstr "[cli 教程](cli.md)：从 JSON 文件为整个注册表构建报告。"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:1
msgid "static_search tutorial"
msgstr "static_search 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows you how to build and serve the static site, how its search answers queries, and how to run the same search engine from MoonBit with the `static_search` package. The [static_search design](../design/static_search.md) explains the index and the ranking in detail."
msgstr "本教程介绍如何构建并提供静态站点、它的搜索如何回答查询，以及如何用 `static_search` 包在 MoonBit 中运行同一个搜索引擎。[static_search 设计](../design/static_search.md)详细解释了索引和排序。"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:11
msgid "build and serve the static site"
msgstr "构建并提供静态站点"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:12
msgid "find packages"
msgstr "查找包"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:12
msgid "the native expression language, for example `json AND score>=180`"
msgstr "原生表达式语言，例如 `json AND score>=180`"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:13
msgid "predict the order of results"
msgstr "预测结果的顺序"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:13
msgid "relevance (matched terms), then rank position, then name"
msgstr "相关度（匹配的项数），然后是名次，然后是名称"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:14
msgid "search an index from MoonBit"
msgstr "在 MoonBit 中搜索索引"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:15
msgid "test one package against a query"
msgstr "用一个查询检验一个包"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:19
msgid "Add the module and import the two packages:"
msgstr "添加模块并导入这两个包："

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:32
msgid "Search a small index:"
msgstr "搜索一个小索引："

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:60
msgid "The parameters are those of the web interface; see the [query tutorial](query.md) for the expression language. The package builds for every target, so `moon test --target all` runs this on each backend."
msgstr "参数就是 Web 界面的参数；表达式语言见 [query 教程](query.md)。该包可为所有目标构建，因此 `moon test --target all` 会在每个后端上运行它。"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:66
msgid "Build and serve the static site"
msgstr "构建并提供静态站点"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:68
msgid "From the repository root:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录下："

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:77
msgid "`build:static-data` needs the local registry index under `~/.moon/registry/index/user` (run `moon update` first). The search index is `public/data/search/search-index.json`; the browser loads it once into a Web Worker, which runs the MoonBit engine compiled to JavaScript."
msgstr "`build:static-data` 需要 `~/.moon/registry/index/user` 下的本地注册表索引（先运行 `moon update`）。搜索索引是 `public/data/search/search-index.json`；浏览器会把它一次性加载到 Web Worker 中，由后者运行编译为 JavaScript 的 MoonBit 引擎。"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:82
msgid "Write queries"
msgstr "编写查询"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:87
msgid "the substring `http client`, space included"
msgstr "子串 `http client`，包括其中的空格"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:88
msgid "packages of that owner with a keyword containing `json`"
msgstr "该所有者的、关键词包含 `json` 的包"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:89
msgid "YAML or TOML packages outside rank `D`"
msgstr "等级不是 `D` 的 YAML 或 TOML 包"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:90
msgid "fast-growing packages with at least five recent dependents"
msgstr "至少有五个近期依赖方的快速增长的包"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:91
msgid "released in the last 30 days and used by at least two other owners"
msgstr "在最近 30 天内发布、且被至少两个其他所有者使用的包"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:93
msgid "The flat filters of the interface work too: `rank=S,A` in the URL keeps ranks `S` and `A`, and `limit` and `offset` page through the results."
msgstr "界面的扁平筛选条件同样可用：URL 中的 `rank=S,A` 保留等级 `S` 和 `A`，`limit` 和 `offset` 用于在结果中翻页。"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:96
msgid "Understand the order of results"
msgstr "理解结果的顺序"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:98
msgid "Without an explicit sort, a query orders results by how many of its positive terms a package matches, then by rank position, then by name; without a query the list is ordered by rank position. With an explicit sort, `order` flips the key, and ties are always listed best-ranked first."
msgstr "没有显式排序时，有查询的结果按一个包匹配的正项数排序，然后按名次，然后按名称；没有查询时，列表按名次排序。有显式排序时，`order` 翻转排序键，而并列项总是按名次从好到差列出。"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:144
msgid "`alice/json` matches both words; the other two match one each and are ordered by rank position (all positions are `0` here, so by name). With `json AND parser` only `alice/json` matches. Results that tie on relevance are always ordered by rank position and then by name, whatever the sort direction."
msgstr "`alice/json` 匹配两个词；另外两个各匹配一个，按名次排序（这里所有名次都是 `0`，因此按名称排序）。用 `json AND parser` 时只有 `alice/json` 匹配。相关度相同的结果总是先按名次、再按名称排序，与排序方向无关。"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:150
msgid "Use the engine from JavaScript"
msgstr "在 JavaScript 中使用该引擎"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:152
msgid "`npm run build:moonbit` writes `lib/moonbit/static_search/static_search.js`. `lib/static-search.ts` wraps it:"
msgstr "`npm run build:moonbit` 写出 `lib/moonbit/static_search/static_search.js`。`lib/static-search.ts` 包装它："

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:166
msgid "**Implicit AND.** `json parser` without `AND` is a syntax error in the expression language. In the simple search field (`q`) the same text is one substring, `json parser`."
msgstr "**隐式 AND。** 在表达式语言中，不带 `AND` 的 `json parser` 是语法错误。在简单搜索字段（`q`）中，同样的文本是一个子串 `json parser`。"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:169
msgid "**Field operators.** `score:180` means `score = 180`, not at least 180. Use `score>=180`."
msgstr "**字段运算符。** `score:180` 表示 `score = 180`，而不是至少 180。请使用 `score>=180`。"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:171
msgid "**`NOT` does not raise relevance.** Only positive terms count, so for `NOT rank=D OR json` every package that mentions `json` ranks above the rest, by score among themselves, whatever its rank."
msgstr "**`NOT` 不会提高相关度。** 只有正词项计数，因此对 `NOT rank=D OR json`，每个提到 `json` 的包都排在其余包之前，彼此之间按分数排序，与等级无关。"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:174
msgid "**Index fields.** An index exported before scoring v2 lacks `rank_position` and the other new counts; `load_index` rejects it. Export the data again."
msgstr "**索引字段。** 在评分 v2 之前导出的索引缺少 `rank_position` 和其他新增的计数；`load_index` 会拒绝它。请重新导出数据。"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:180
msgid "[static_search design](../design/static_search.md) for the index layout, the relevance count, the collation and the cost of a query."
msgstr "[static_search 设计](../design/static_search.md)：索引布局、相关度计数、排序规则以及查询的开销。"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:182
msgid "[static_search API](../api/static_search.md) for every function and the JavaScript exports."
msgstr "[static_search API](../api/static_search.md)：每个函数和 JavaScript 导出项。"

#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:185
msgid "[architecture guide](../architecture.md) for the whole data pipeline."
msgstr "[架构指南](../architecture.md)：完整的数据管道。"

#~ msgid "Exit status `1` implies an `error` object on standard output."
#~ msgstr "退出状态 `1` 意味着标准输出上有一个 `error` 对象。"

#~ msgid "Check the exit status before you use the output. A missing input file also exits with status `1`, but Node.js prints a stack trace to standard error instead of JSON."
#~ msgstr "使用输出之前先检查退出状态。输入文件缺失时同样以状态 `1` 退出，但 Node.js 会向标准错误输出堆栈跟踪，而不是 JSON。"

#~ msgid "`score-snapshot` computes one score snapshot from a JSON input file."
#~ msgstr "`score-snapshot` 根据一个 JSON 输入文件计算一个分数快照。"

#~ msgid "The file must contain one JSON object. Each key is optional:"
#~ msgstr "文件必须包含一个 JSON 对象。每个键都是可选的："

#~ msgid "Signal"
#~ msgstr "信号"

#~ msgid "Current dependents."
#~ msgstr "当前的依赖方数量。"

#~ msgid "Current recent dependents."
#~ msgstr "当前的近期依赖方数量。"

#~ msgid "Current downloads."
#~ msgstr "当前的下载量。"

#~ msgid "Recent dependents 30 days ago."
#~ msgstr "30 天前的近期依赖方数量。"

#~ msgid "Downloads 30 days ago."
#~ msgstr "30 天前的下载量。"

#~ msgid "Days since the latest release, 30 days ago."
#~ msgstr "30 天前距最新发布的天数。"

#~ msgid "A value is used when it is a JSON number; it is converted to `Int` by truncation toward zero (`12.9` becomes `12`), and values beyond the `Int` range saturate at its bounds. A missing key, a value of any other JSON type (including a numeric string such as `\"20\"`) and a top-level value that is not an object all count as `0`. The score functions then clamp negative values to `0`. Unknown keys are ignored."
#~ msgstr "值为 JSON 数字时才会被采用：它通过向零截断转换为 `Int`（`12.9` 变为 `12`），超出 `Int` 范围的值会饱和到其边界。缺失的键、其他任何 JSON 类型的值（包括 `\"20\"` 这样的数字字符串）以及顶层不是对象的值都按 `0` 处理。随后评分函数会把负值截为 `0`。未知的键会被忽略。"

#~ msgid "On success the command prints one line, the JSON form of the [`ScoreSnapshot`](score.md#scoresnapshot), and exits with status `0`. Fields appear in declaration order. A `NaN` field, which only arises from a count of `2147483647` or more, is written as the string `\"NaN\"`. For the input above the output is:"
#~ msgstr "成功时，命令输出一行内容，即 [`ScoreSnapshot`](score.md#scoresnapshot) 的 JSON 形式，并以状态 `0` 退出。字段按声明顺序排列。值为 `NaN` 的字段（只会由 `2147483647` 或更大的计数产生）会写成字符串 `\"NaN\"`。对于上面的输入，输出为："

#~ msgid "Source: [`src/score/impact_factor.mbt`](../../../src/score/impact_factor.mbt). The mathematics behind the formula is in the [score design](../design/score.md)."
#~ msgstr "源码：[`src/score/impact_factor.mbt`](../../../src/score/impact_factor.mbt)。公式背后的数学见 [score 设计](../design/score.md)。"

#~ msgid "Every scoring function takes the same four signals, in this order:"
#~ msgstr "每个评分函数都按以下顺序接收同样的四个信号："

#~ msgid "Parameter"
#~ msgstr "参数"

#~ msgid "Number of packages that depend on this package."
#~ msgstr "依赖本包的包的数量。"

#~ msgid "Number of those dependents that first appeared in the recent window."
#~ msgstr "这些依赖方中首次出现在近期窗口内的数量。"

#~ msgid "The functions do not check that the signals are consistent, for example that `recent_dependents <= dependents`. Negative values are clamped to `0`. The index builder fills the signals from a local registry snapshot; see the [architecture guide](../architecture.md)."
#~ msgstr "这些函数不检查信号之间是否一致，例如是否满足 `recent_dependents <= dependents`。负值会被截为 `0`。索引构建器根据本地注册表快照填写这些信号；参见[架构指南](../architecture.md)。"

#~ msgid "Scores"
#~ msgstr "分数"

#~ msgid "where $m(t)$ is `activity_multiplier(t)`. The score is $0$ exactly when all three counts are $0$ or negative, and it never decreases when a count grows. It has no upper limit by design, but for counts below $2^{31} - 1$ it stays below about $2094$."
#~ msgstr "其中 $m(t)$ 是 `activity_multiplier(t)`。当且仅当三个计数都为 $0$ 或负数时分数为 $0$，并且任何计数增大时分数都不会减小。按设计分数没有上限，但当计数小于 $2^{31} - 1$ 时，分数始终低于约 $2094$。"

